<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">jhn</book>
  <para style="h">Yoni Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yoni Yesu a Fe Xibaru Faɲin Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yoni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yoni</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yoni Yesu a Fe Xibaru Faɲin Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Marigi Yesu fɔxɔrabira naanin nan Yesu a taruxun nun a falane sɛbɛxi Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin barakani: Matiyu nun Maraka nun Luka e nun Yoni. Yoni a fe yɛba kiin nan baxi bonne ma. A luxi alo Yoni yi waxi Yesu a fe tilinxine nan makɛnɛn fe yi muxune xa. Na kui, a Yesu a fala wuyaxi sɛbɛxi nɛn bonne mi naxanye sɛbɛxi e nun a taruxuna ndee. A mɔn Yesu a dunuɲa yi gidin bunna yɛbama miriya tilinxin nin. Yoni Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛxi nɛn fɔ ɲɛɛ tonge naanin hanma ɲɛɛ tonge sennin ɲɔxɔndɔn Yesu te xanbini kore xɔnna ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yireni ito miriya tilinxina ndee nan singe yitama naxan Yesu fa xunna yɛbama. Yoni Yesu tiden yɛbama fala tilinxin nin alogo muxune xa e miri ki faɲi Yesu a fe ma. Yoni mi Yesu bari kiin yɛbaxi. Yesu a dunuɲa yi gidini, a xaran wuyaxi ti nɛn a yamaan xa. A mɔn kabanako fe wuyaxi liga nɛn. Yoni na nan yɛbama Ningila Yesu kui. Yoni mɔn Yesu a fala dɔnxɛne yɛbama dangu bonne ra. Dɔnxɛn na, a Yesu a sayaan nan yɛbama e nun a rakeli fena sayani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yoni Yesu a falane nan sɛbɛxi itoe ra naxanye Yesu kɛɲaan yitama en na: Yesu naxa, “N tan nan nii rakisin balon na.” (Yoni 6.35 nun 6.41 nun 6.48 nun 6.51) Yesu naxa, “N tan nan dunuɲa kɛnɛnna ra.” (Yoni 8.12) Yesu naxa, “N tan nan sansanna so dɛɛn na yɛxɛɛne xa.” (Yoni 10.7) Yesu naxa, “N tan nan xuruse raba faɲin na.” (Yoni 10.11 nun 10.14) Yesu naxa, “N tan nan marakeli tiin na sayani e nun nii rakisin na.” (Yoni 11.25) Yesu naxa, “Kiraan nan n tan na, e nun ɲɔndina e nun nii rakisina.” (Yoni 14.6) Yesu naxa, “N tan nan ɲɔndin binla ra alo wudi binla.” (Yoni 15.1 nun 15.5)</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesu mɔn a Alayana a fe falaxi wundoni na yire sifana ndee yi, a naxa, “N tan nan a ra, naxan na yi.” (Yoni 8.24 nun 8.28 nun 8.58 nun 13.19 nun 18.5) Kitabun yiren naxan xili Xɔrɔyaan sora 3.14, na naxa fa fala Ala xinla yɛtɛɛn findixi na falan nan na bayo Ala naxa mɛnni, “N tan na a ra, Ala naxan na yi.” Ala mɔn naxa mɛnni fa fala a yɛtɛɛn xili nɛn “N Na Yi.” Nayi, Yesu to a falama muxune xa fa fala “N tan nan a ra, naxan na yi,” na bunna nɛɛn fa fala Yesu findixi Alaa falan nan na, falan naxan findixi Ala ra. (Yoni 1.1).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa Falana fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Dunuɲa fɔlɔni, Alaa Falan yi na. Falan yi Ala fɛma. Falan nan mɔn yi Ala ra.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.1</char> <char style="fk">Alaa Falani</char> ito findixi Yesu nan na. A mato Yoni 1.14 kui. Ala dunuɲa da a falan naxan xɔn a fɔlɔni, Ala na nan findixi muxun na, Yesu.</note> <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>A yi Ala fɛma a fɔlɔni. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Ala seen birin daxi a tan nan xɔn ma. Ala mi sese daxi a tan xanbi. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Nii rakisin yi a tan nin. Na nii rakisin yi findi kɛnɛnna ra adamadiine xa. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Kɛnɛnna yi mini dimini, koni dimin mi a nɔ.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Ala yi muxuna nde xɛ naxan yi xili Yoni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.6</char> Yoni Marafu Tiin nan Yoni ito ra.</note> <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Na yi fa, a findi kɛnɛnna seren na, alogo muxun birin xa dɛnkɛlɛya a tan xɔn. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Kɛnɛnna mi yi a tan na, koni a fa nɛn, alogo a xa fa kɛnɛnna sereyaan ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Kɛnɛnna yɛtɛɛn nan yi na ra, naxan famatɔ yi a ra dunuɲa muxune birin makɛnɛndeni.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Alaa Falan yi dunuɲa yi. Dunuɲa da a tan nan na, koni dunuɲa muxune mi a kolon. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>A fa nɛn a konni, koni a kon kaane mi a rasuxu. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Koni naxanye a rasuxu e dɛnkɛlɛya a xinli, a sɛnbɛn fi nɛn ne ma e findi Alaa diine ra. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>E mi barixi Ala diine ra adamadiyaan kiin xan xɔn ma hanma fati bɛndɛna hanma muxun sagona, koni na fataxi Ala nan na.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Alaa Falan yi findi fati bɛndɛn na, a yi lu en yɛ. Nxu bata a binyen to, alo fafana dii xɛmɛ kedenna binyena, a lugoxi hinanna nun ɲɔndin na.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Yoni yi a feen fala a xuini texin na, a naxa, “N na a tan nan ma fe fala, n naxa, ‘A fama n xanbi ra, koni a gbo n tan xa amasɔtɔ benun n tan xa da, a tan yi na.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>En birin bata barakan sɔtɔ barakan fari a hinan kamalixin xɔn ma. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Amasɔtɔ Alaa sariyan falaxi yamaan xa Musa nan xɔn ma, koni hinanna nun ɲɔndin faxi Yesu nan xɔn ma, Alaa Muxu Sugandixina. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Muxu yo munma Ala to singen. Koni a Dii Xɛmɛ keden peen naxan nun a tan Ala lan, naxan a fafe fɛma, na nan bata Ala yita en na.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yoni Marafu Tiina sereyana fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 3.1-12, Maraka 1.1-8, Luka 3.1-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Yoni sereyani ito nan ba, Yahudiyane to saraxaraline nun Lewine xɛ a ma a maxɔdindeni keli Yerusalɛn taani, e naxa, “Nde i tan na?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Yoni mi tondi a falɛ, a yi a fala e birin yɛtagi, a naxa, “Alaa Muxu Sugandixin mi n tan na.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>E yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “Nde fa i tan na? Nabi Eli nan i tan na ba?” Yoni yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn, na mi n tan na.” E mɔn yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “Nabiin nan i tan na ba?” A yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn, na mi n tan na.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>E yi a fala, e naxa, “Nde i tan na? Amasɔtɔ naxanye nxu xɛxi, fɔ nxu xa sa nxu dɛntɛgɛ nɛn ne xa. I nanse falɛ i yɛtɛ a fe yi?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Yoni yi e yabi Nabi Esayi a falane xɔn, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">“N tan na a ra naxan a xuini tema tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">n naxa, ‘Ɛ kira tinxinxin nafala Marigin xa.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.23</char> Esayi 40.3</note> ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Farisi muxun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.24</char> <char style="fk">Farisi muxune:</char> Yahudiyane nan yi muxuni itoe ra naxanye lan ma fe yi a ra, e xa dinan suxu kii kedenni. E tan nan e sɔbɛ so Nabi Musaa sariyan suxun ma dangu Yahudiyan bonne ra. E mɔn yi e benbane namunne suxuma kii xɔdɛxɛni. E tan yi laxi malekane ra. E mɔn yi laxi a ra a muxune kelima nɛn sayani.</note> naxanye yi xɛxi Yoni ma, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>ne yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “Xa Alaa Muxu Sugandixin mi i tan na, Nabi Eli mi i tan na, nabi mi i tan na, nanfera i fa muxune rafuma igeni e sariɲan feen na?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Yoni yi e yabi, a naxa, “N tan marafuun tima igen nin, koni muxuna nde ɛ tagi ɛ mi naxan kolon. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>A fama nɛn n xanbi ra, koni n tan mi lan hali n yi findi a sankidi fulunna ra.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Ito birin ligaxi Betani taan nin, Yurudɛn baan kidima, Yoni yi muxune rafuma igeni dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa Yɛxɛɛ Diina fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Na xɔtɔn bode, Yoni yi Yesu to fɛ a fɛma, a naxa, “Alaa Yɛxɛɛ Diin nan ito ra, naxan dunuɲa birin yulubin bama. <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>N yi ito nan ma fe falama, n naxa, ‘Muxuna nde fama n xanbi ra, koni a gbo n tan xa amasɔtɔ benun n tan xa bari, a tan yi na.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>N tan mi yi a kolon nun, koni n bata fa yamaan nafudeni igeni alogo n xa a yita Isirayila yamaan na.” <verse eid="JHN 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Yoni mɔn yi sereyani ito ba, a naxa, “N bata Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin to godɛ a ma ganba sawurani, a yi lu a ma. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>N mi yi a kolon nun, koni naxan n nafaxi yamaan nafudeni igeni, na a fala n xa nɛn, a naxa, ‘I na Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin to godɛ naxan ma, a tan nan marafuun tima Nii Sariɲanxin na.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>N bata a to, n yi a seren ba, fa fala Alaa Dii Xɛmɛna a tan nan na.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a xarandii singene fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Na xɔtɔn bode Yoni nun a xarandii firin yi tixi nun, <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>a yi Yesu to danguɛ, a naxa, “Alaa Yɛxɛɛ Diin nan ito ra!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>A xarandii firinna yi a xuiin mɛ, e siga Yesu fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yesu yi a yɛɛ raxɛtɛ, a yi e to biraxi a fɔxɔ ra, a yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ nanse fenma?” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Rabi, i yigiyaxi minɛn?” Rabi bunna nɛɛn fa fala, “Karamɔxɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>A yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ fa a mato.” Se din waxatin nan yi a ra nun. E yi siga, e sa a yigiyaden to. E ɲinbari raso a fɛma.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Xarandii firinna naxanye Yoni xuiin mɛ e bira Yesu fɔxɔ ra, na keden yi xili nɛn Andire, Simɔn Piyɛri xunyɛna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.40</char> Muxune mɔn Piyɛri ma a Pita.</note> <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Andire yi a tada Simɔn fen keden na, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Nxu bata Mesiya to.” Mesiya bunna nɛɛn fa fala, “Alaa Muxu Sugandixina.” <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Na xanbi ra, a fa Simɔn na Yesu fɛma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesu yi a mato, a naxa, “Simɔn nan i tan na, Yoni a dii xɛmɛna. I xili bama nɛn sɔnɔn, Sifasi.” Xinli ito nun Piyɛri, xili kedenna nan e ra.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.42</char> <char style="fk">Piyɛri</char> xinla bunna nɛɛn fa fala gɛmɛna.</note><verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi Filipi nun Nataniyɛli xili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Na xɔtɔn bode Yesu yi a ragidi, a xa siga Galile yamanani. A yi Filipi to, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Bira n fɔxɔ ra!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Filipi yi kelixi Betasada taan nin alo Andire nun Piyɛri. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Filipi yi Nataniyɛli to, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Musa muxun naxan ma fe sɛbɛ Sariya Kitabun kui e nun nabine fan naxan ma fe sɛbɛ, nxu bata a to, Yusufu a dii xɛmɛna Yesu, Nasarɛti kaana.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Nataniyɛli yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Se faɲin nɔɛ kelɛ Nasarɛti ba?” Filipi yi a yabi, a naxa, “Fa a mato.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Yesu Nataniyɛli to fɛ a fɛma waxatin naxan yi, a naxa, “Isirayila kaan yɛtɛɛn nan ito ra! Yanfa mi naxan ma fe yi!” <verse eid="JHN 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Nataniyɛli yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “I n kolonxi di?” Yesu yi a yabi a naxa, “N ni i toxi nɛn, i xɔdɛ binla bun ma waxatin naxan yi benun Filipi xa i xili.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Nataniyɛli yi a yabi, a naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn nan i tan na! Isirayila Mangan nan i tan na!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yesu yi a fala, a naxa, “N to a falaxi i xa, n naxa, ‘n bata yi i to xɔdɛ binla bun ma,’ i dɛnkɛlɛyaxi n ma na nan na ba? I feene toma nɛn naxanye gbo na xa!” <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, ɛ ariyanna dɛɛn nabixin toma nɛn, ɛ yi Ala malekane to, e tema, e godoma Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn xɔn ma!”<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ɲaxalandi tiina Kana taani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Soge firin danguxina, e siga ɲaxalandi tideni Kana taani, Galile yamanani. Yesu nga yi na nun. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>E yi Yesu nun a xarandiine fan xili na ɲaxalandi tiini. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Manpaan to dasa, Yesu nga yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Manpaan bata ɲan e yii.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “N na, en ma fe na yi? N ma waxatin munma a li singen.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Yesu nga yi a fala walikɛne xa, a naxa, “A na naxan fala ɛ xa, ɛ na liga.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Awa, ige fɛɲɛ sennin yi dɔxi na nun, naxanye yi findixi Yahudiyane marasariɲan ige sa seen na, litiri yɛ kɛmɛ nan yi sama e keden kedenna birin kui. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yesu yi a fala walikɛne xa, a naxa, “Ɛ ige fɛɲɛni itoe rafe igen na.” E yi e rafe igen na pen! <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ igena nde sɛgɛ, ɛ siga a ra ɲaxalandi ti sumunna kuntigin fɛma.” E yi siga a ra a xa. <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Ɲaxalandi ti sumunna kuntigin yi igen mato, a bata maxɛtɛ manpaan na, koni a mi yi a keliden kolon. Anu, walikɛɛn naxanye igen sɛgɛ, ne yi a kolon. Nanara, kuntigin yi ɲaxalandi kanna xili, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Manpa faɲin nan soma muxune yii singen, na xanbi ra, manpaan na muxune suxu waxatin naxan yi, i yi nde gbɛtɛ ramini naxan mi fan ɲaxi ra. Koni i bata manpa faɲin namara han iki!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Yesu a kabanako fe singen ni ito ra, a naxan liga Kana taani Galile yamanani. A yi a binyen mayita a xarandiine ra, ne yi la a ra.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu nun a nga nun a xunyɛne nun a xarandiine yi siga Kapɛrunan yi, e yi sa xi dando ti na.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi siga Ala Batu Banxini</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 21.12-13, Maraka 11.15-17, Luka 19.45-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Waxatin bata yi maso Yahudiyane Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.13</char> <char style="fk">Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla:</char> Musaa waxatini, Ala fitina feen nafa nɛn Firawona yamaan ma, malekan yi fa e dii singene birin faxa kɔɛ kedenna ra. Koni, Isirayila kaane yi saraxa wunla xuya e banxine dɛ wudine ma, saya malekan yi dangu e xun ma. Na feen sanla ni ito ra. A mato Xɔrɔyaan 12.1-13 kui.</note> yi rabama waxatin naxan yi nun, Yesu yi siga Yerusalɛn taani. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>A yi muxune li Ala Batu Banxin tanden ma, e ɲingene nun yɛxɛɛne nun ganbane matima na. Gbeti masarana ndee fan yi dɔxi na nun. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Nayi, a yi fɔsɔnna rafala, a yi e birin kedi Ala Batu Banxini, ɲingene nun yɛxɛɛne, a yi gbeti masarane gbeti gbananne raxuya ayi bɔxɔni, a yi e tabanle rafelen. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Muxun naxanye yi ganba matini, a yi a fala ne xa, a naxa, “Ɛ itoe birin ba be. Ɛ nama n Fafe Alaa banxin findi sare soden na!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Naxan sɛbɛxi Kitabuni, na feen yi rabira a xarandiine ma, a naxa, “I ya banxina fe xaminna n na han a n ganma alo tɛɛna!”<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Yahudiyane yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “I nɔɛ taxamasenna mundun yitɛ nxu ra fa fala sɛnbɛna i yii, i yi na birin liga?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ Alaa banxini ito kala, n mɔn a tiyɛ soge saxanna bun.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Yahudiyane yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Ala Batu Banxini ito tixi ɲɛɛ tonge naanin e nun ɲɛɛ sennin nan bun ma. I tan nɔɛ na tiyɛ soge saxanna bun?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Koni Yesu yi Ala Batu Banxin naxan ma fe falama, a yɛtɛɛn fati bɛndɛn nan yi na ra. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Nanara, Yesu to keli sayani, a falan yi rabira a xarandiine ma. E yi la Kitabun na e nun Yesu a fala tixine.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu muxune kui feene kolon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Yesu yi Yerusalɛn taani waxatin naxan yi Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla waxatini, muxu wuyaxi yi a kabanako feene to, e dɛnkɛlɛya a ma. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Koni Yesu mi yi a lannayaan saxi e yi, bayo a yi adamadiine birin kui feene kolon. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>A mako mi yi a ma, e xa muxu yo a fe fala a xa, bayo a tan yɛtɛɛn yi adamadiin kui feene kolon.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nun Nikodɛmi a fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Farisi muxuna nde yi na nun, a yi xili Nikodɛmi, Yahudiyane kuntigina nde nan yi a ra. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Na yi fa Yesu fɛma kɔɛɛn na, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, nxu a kolon a karamɔxɔn nan i ra fata Ala ra. I kabanako feen naxanye ligama, muxu yo mi nɔɛ ne ligɛ xa Ala mi a xɔn ma.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala i xa, xa muxun mɔn mi xɛtɛ, a bari a nɛnɛn na, a mi nɔɛ Alaa Mangayaan toɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nikodɛmi yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Muxun naxan bata fori, na mɔn nɔɛ barɛ di? A mi nɔɛ xɛtɛ a nga fatini, a mɔn yi a bari!” <verse eid="JHN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala i xa, muxu yo mi nɔɛ soɛ Alaa Mangayani fɔ a bari fata igen nun Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin na. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Naxan barixi fati bɛndɛni, fati bɛndɛn nan na ra. Naxan barixi Alaa Nii Sariɲanxini, niin nan na ra. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>I nama kabɛ bayo n bata a fala i xa, n naxa, ‘Fɔ ɛ mɔn xa xɛtɛ, ɛ bari a nɛnɛn na.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Foyen fama yiren nin dɛnaxan na a kɛnɛn, i yi a xuiin mɛ, koni i mi a keliden kolon, i mɔn mi a sigaden kolon. A na kii nin birin xa naxanye na bari Alaa Nii Sariɲanxini.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nikodɛmi yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Na ligan di nayi?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “Isirayila kaane karamɔxɔn nan i tan na, i mi feni itoe kolon ba? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala i xa, nxu naxan kolon, nxu na nan falama. Nxu naxan toxi, nxu na nan sereya bama. Koni hali na, ɛ mi nxɔ sereya falan suxi. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Nba, xa n dunuɲa feene fala ɛ xa, ɛ mi la ne ra. N na kore xɔnna feene fala ɛ xa, ɛ lama ne ra di? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Muxu yo munma te ariyanna yi singen, fɔ naxan kelixi ariyanna yi, n tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛna.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>“Musa saɲini te kore kii naxan yi tonbonni wudin ma, fɔ n tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn fan xa yite na kii nin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.14</char> <char style="fk">Saɲini te</char> feen Musa xɔn, na mato Yatɛne 21.8-9 kui. Yesu <char style="fk">yite</char> nɛn a yelin xanbini gbangbanɲɛ wudin ma. A mɔn yi <char style="fk">te</char> ariyanna yi. Yesu falan tima na fe firinna nan ma.</note> <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>alogo naxan yo na dɛnkɛlɛya n ma, na xa habadan nii rakisin sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Amasɔtɔ Ala bata dunuɲa xanu han a bata a Dii Xɛmɛ keden peen fi en ma, alogo muxu yo na dɛnkɛlɛya a ma, na nama halagi fɔ a habadan nii rakisin sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Bayo Ala mi a Dii Xɛmɛn nafaxi dunuɲa yi alogo a xa dunuɲa muxune yalagi, koni alogo dunuɲa muxune xa kisi a xɔn ma.”<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>“Naxan yo na dɛnkɛlɛya a ma, na kanna mi fa yalagin sɔnɔn. Koni naxanye mi dɛnkɛlɛyaxi a ma, ne bata yelin yalagɛ, bayo e mi dɛnkɛlɛyaxi Alaa Dii Xɛmɛ keden peen ma. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>E yalagima ito nan na: Kɛnɛnna bata fa dunuɲa yi koni dimin nan nafan adamadiine ma dangu kɛnɛnna ra, amasɔtɔ e kɛwanle mi fan. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Naxan yo fe ɲaxin ligama, kɛnɛnna mi rafan na ma. Na mi minin kɛnɛnna ma, alogo a sɔnna nama mini kɛnɛnni. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Koni naxan fe tinxinxin ligama, na fama nɛn kɛnɛnna ma, alogo yamaan xa a yigbɛ a a walima Ala sagoon nin.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nun Yoni a fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu nun a xarandiine yi siga Yudaya yamanani. A waxati ti e fɛma. A yi yamaan nafuma igeni e tubi feen na. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Yoni fan yi marafuun tima Ayenon xudeni Salin taan dɛxɔn ma, amasɔtɔ ige gbeen yi na nun. Yamaan yi lu sigɛ mɛnni e rafudeni. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Yoni munma yi sa kasoon na singen.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Yoni a xarandiina ndee nun Yahudiyana nde yi e bode matandi fɔlɔ lan marasariɲan feen ma. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>E yi siga Yoni fɛma, e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, i xaxili luxi a xɔn ma ba, ɛ nun naxan yi Yurudɛn kidima, i naxan ma fe sereya ba nxu xa. Nba iki, a marafuun tima, muxune birin sigama a fɛma!” <verse eid="JHN 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yoni yi e yabi, a naxa, “Muxun mi sese sɔtɔma fɔ Ala na naxan fi a ma. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Ɛ tan yɛtɛɛn nan n seren na, a n na a fala nɛn, n naxa, ‘Alaa Muxu Sugandixin mi n tan na, xɛraan nan tun n tan na a yɛɛ ra.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Ɲaxalandi kanna nan gbee ɲaxanla ra. Koni a xɔyin naxan tixi a fɛma, na tuli matixi a ra. A na a xuiin mɛ waxatin naxan yi, a sɛwama nɛn. N ma sɛwan na kii nin, a dɛfexi. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Fɔ a tan xa yite nɛn, n tan yi magodo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naxan kelixi ariyanna yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>“Naxan kelixi kore xɔnna ma, na seen birin xun na. Naxan kelixi dunuɲa yi, dunuɲa gbeen nan na ra. Na dunuɲa feene nan falama. Naxan kelixi ariyanna yi, na nan seen birin xun na. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>A naxan toxi, a a mɛ, a na nan sereya bama koni yamaan mi a sereya falan suxi. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Naxan na a falan suxu, na bata a mayita a Ala nan tinxin. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Ala naxan xɛxi, na Alaa falan nan tima amasɔtɔ Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin fima a ma nɛn dan mi naxan na! <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Fafe Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn nafan a ma. A bata feen birin taxu a ra. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Naxan na dɛnkɛlɛya a Dii Xɛmɛn ma, na habadan nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn. Naxan mi laxi a Dii Xɛmɛn na, na mi nii rakisin sɔtɛ, bayo Alaa xɔlɔn luma nɛn a fari!”<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Samariya kaa ɲaxanla fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Farisi muxune yi a mɛ fa fala Yesu yi xarandiine sɔtɔma dangu Yoni ra, a yi e rafu igeni. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Anu, Yesu yɛtɛɛn mi yi marafuun tima, koni a xarandiine nan yi muxune rafuma. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Yesu to muxune falane mɛ, a keli Yudaya yamanani, a siga Galile yamanani.<verse eid="JHN 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>A yi lan nun a xa dangu Samariya yamanani. <verse eid="JHN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>A taana nde li Samariya yamanani naxan xili Sikara, naxan yi maso xɛɛn na Yaxuba naxan so a dii xɛmɛn Yusufu yii. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Yaxubaa xɔɲinna yi na yi. Yesu bata yi xadan siga tideni, a yi dɔxɔ na xɔɲinna dɛ ra yanyin na.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Samariya kaa ɲaxanla nde yi fa ige badeni. Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N ki igeni, n xa n min.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>A xarandiine bata yi siga taani donse saradeni. <verse eid="JHN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Samariya kaa ɲaxanla yi a yabi, a naxa, “Yahudiyan nan i tan na, Samariya kaan nan n tan na. I n xandima igeni nanfera?” Amasɔtɔ Yahudiyane mako mi Samariya kaane ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.9</char> Na waxatini Yahudiyane yi <char style="fk">Samariya kaane</char> yatɛxi kafirine nan na. E fe fɔlɔden sɛbɛxi Mangane Firinden 17.24 kui.</note> <verse eid="JHN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “Xa i yi Alaa kiseen kolon nun e nun naxan i xandixi igeni, xa i yi na fan kolon nun, i yi a xandima nɛn nun, a yi siimaya igen fi i ma.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Ɲaxanla yi a fala, a naxa, “N fafe, ige rate se mi i yii, anu igen makuya. I na siimaya igen sɔtɔn minɛn yi? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Nxu benba Yaxuba nan xɔɲinni ito fixi nxu ma, a tan nun a diine nun a xuruseene birin yi e minma be nin nun. I tan gbo Yaxuba xa ba?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “Muxu yo igeni ito min, min xɔnla a suxuma nɛn mɔn, <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>koni n tan igen naxan fima muxune ma, xa muxun na min, min xɔnla mi fa a suxuma sɔnɔn. Amasɔtɔ n ni igen naxan fima a ma, na luma nɛn a yi alo tigi igen naxan minima han a habadan nii rakisin sɔtɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Ɲaxanla yi a fala, a naxa, “N fafe, na igen fi n ma alogo min xɔnla nama fa n suxu sɔnɔn, n mɔn yi fa ige badeni be.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Sa i ya xɛmɛn xili, ɛ fa be.” <verse eid="JHN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Ɲaxanla yi a yabi, a naxa, “Xɛmɛn mi n yii.” Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “I bata ɲɔndin fala fa fala xɛmɛ mi i yii. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Koni i bata yi dɔxɔ xɛmɛ suulun xɔn ma nun. I naxan yii iki, i ya xɛmɛn yɛtɛɛn mi na ra. I bata ɲɔndin fala n xa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Ɲaxanla yi a fala, a naxa, “N fafe, n bata a kolon fa yati, fa fala nabiin nan i tan na. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Nxu tan Samariya kaane, nxu benbane Ala batu geyani ito nan fari, koni ɛ tan Yahudiyane naxa, a lan nɛn, en xa Ala batu Yerusalɛn nin.” <verse eid="JHN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yesu yi a fala ɲaxanla xa, a naxa, “La n na, waxatina nde fama, yamaan mi fa fama Fafe Ala batudeni geyani ito fari, e mɔn mi a batuɛ Yerusalɛn taan fan yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Ɛ tan Samariya kaane, ɛ naxan batuma, ɛ mi na kolon. Nxu tan Yahudiyane naxan batuma, nxu na kolon, amasɔtɔ kisi feen fataxi Yahudiyane nan na. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Koni waxatina nde fama, a yɛtɛɛn bata a li, Ala batu muxu kɛndɛne fama Fafe Ala batudeni niin nun ɲɔndini nɛn yati! Bayo Fafe Ala na muxu sifane nan fenma, e yi a batu. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Niin nan Ala ra. Naxanye a batuma, ne xa a batu niin nun ɲɔndin yatin nin.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Ɲaxanla yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N na a kolon fa fala Mesiya fama nɛn, naxan xili Alaa Muxu Sugandixina. A na fa waxatin naxan yi, a feen birin yɛbama nxu xa nɛn.” <verse eid="JHN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “A tan nan n tan na, n tan naxan falan tima i xa ito ra.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Na waxatin yɛtɛni, Yesu a xarandiine yi fa, e kabɛ amasɔtɔ e bata a li falan tiyɛ ɲaxanla xa. Koni e sese mi ɲaxanla maxɔdin fa fala, “I waxi nanse xɔn?” E mi Yesu fan maxɔdin fa fala, “I nanse falama ɲaxanla xa?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Nba, ɲaxanla yi ige ba fɛɲɛn lu na, a xɛtɛ taani. A sa a fala yamaan xa, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>a naxa, “Ɛ fa xɛmɛna nde mato, n bata feen naxanye birin liga, a bata ne birin fala n xa. Alaa Muxu Sugandixin mi a ra ba?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Na ma, yamaan yi keli taani, e siga Yesu fɛma.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Xarandiine yi Yesu mafanma na waxatini, e naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, donseen don!” <verse eid="JHN 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Koni a yi e yabi, a naxa, “Donsena n yii, ɛ mi naxan kolon.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Nayi, xarandiine yi e bode maxɔdin fɔlɔ, e naxa, “Muxuna nde bata donseen fi a ma ba?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N ma donseen nan n xɛ muxun sagoon wanla kɛɛn na han wanla yi kamali. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Ɛ a falama nɛn, ɛ naxa, ‘Kike naanin luxi, malo xaba waxatin yi a li,’ koni n xa a fala ɛ xa, ɛ yɛɛn nakeli, ɛ xɛɛne mato. Maala bata mɔ, malo xaba waxatin bata a li. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Malo xabane bata fɔlɔ e saranna sɔtɛ. E naxanye malanma, ne habadan nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn. Nanara, maala bi muxun nun a xaba muxun sɛwama nɛn e bode xɔn ma. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Na kui, ɲɔndin nan sandani ito ra, naxan a falaxi, a naxa, ‘Muxuna nde maala bima, gbɛtɛ yi a xaba.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>N bata ɛ xɛ, ɛ sa maala xaba, ɛ mi naxan walixi. Muxu gbɛtɛye nan a walixi. Ɛ tan yi tɔnɔ sɔtɔ e wanli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Samariya kaan naxanye yi na taani, ne wuyaxi yi dɛnkɛlɛya Yesu ma na ɲaxanla falana fe ra, a naxa, “N feen naxan birin ligaxi, a bata na fala n xa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Nanara, Samariya kaane to fa Yesu fɛma, e yi a mafan, a xa lu e fɛma. Yesu yi lu e fɛma xii firin. <verse eid="JHN 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Muxu wuyaxi gbɛtɛye yi dɛnkɛlɛya Yesu ma a falane fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Ne yi a fala ɲaxanla xa, e naxa, “Nxu bata dɛnkɛlɛya iki koni nxu mi dɛnkɛlɛyaxi i ya falan gbansanna xan ma fe ra bayo nxu fan bata a xuiin mɛ. Nxu bata a kolon yati fa fala dunuɲa muxune rakisimaan nan a tan na.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi kuntigina diini yalan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Yesu to xii firin ti na, a yi siga Galile yamanani. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Yesu yɛtɛɛn bata yi a fala e xa nun, a naxa, “Nabiin mi binyen sɔtɛ a yɛtɛna yamanani.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>A Galile yamanan li waxatin naxan yi, na kaane yi a yisuxu ki faɲi, amasɔtɔ e fan bata yi a fe ligaxine to Yerusalɛn taani Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.45</char> <char style="fk">Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla:</char> Musaa waxatini, Ala fitina feen nafa nɛn Firawona yamaan ma, malekan yi fa e dii singene birin faxa kɔɛ kedenna ra. Koni, Isirayila kaane yi saraxa wunla xuya e banxine dɛ wudine ma, saya malekan yi dangu e xun ma. Na feen sanla ni ito ra. A mato Xɔrɔyaan 12.1-13 kui.</note> waxatini. Bayo e fan yi na nun. <verse eid="JHN 4:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Nayi, Yesu mɔn yi xɛtɛ Kana taani Galile yamanani, a igen maxɛtɛ manpaan na dɛnaxan yi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:46">Mangana kuntigina nde yi mɛnni naxan ma dii xɛmɛn yi furaxi Kapɛrunan yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>A to a mɛ a Yesu bata fa Galile yi sa keli Yudaya yamanani, a yi siga a fɛma, a yi a mafan, alogo a xa siga Kapɛrunan yi, a sa a dii xɛmɛni yalan. Amasɔtɔ a faxamatɔɔn nan yi fa a ra. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Ɛ tan tondixi dɛnkɛlɛyɛ fɔ ɛ na taxamasenne nun kabanako feene to.” <verse eid="JHN 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Mangana kuntigin yi a yabi, a naxa, “N kanna, yandi, fa en siga benun n ma diin xa faxa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yesu yi a fala, a naxa, “Siga, i ya dii xɛmɛn mi faxama.” Xɛmɛn yi la Yesu a falan na, a siga. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>A yi sigama a konni waxatin naxan yi, a lan a walikɛne ra. Ne yi a fala a xa, fa fala a a diin mɔn a nii ra. <verse eid="JHN 4:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>A yi e maxɔdin a dii xɛmɛn fisaxi waxatin naxan yi. E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Xoro yanyi tagini, a fati mawolonna yi a beɲin.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Na yi rabira a fafe ma a Yesu a fala na waxatin nin, a naxa, “I ya dii xɛmɛn mi faxama.” Nanara, a tan nun a denbayaan birin yi dɛnkɛlɛya Yesu ma.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Kabanako feen firinden nan ito ra Yesu naxan liga a to keli Yudaya yamanani siga Galile yamanani.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi lɛbutɛnna rakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi siga Yerusalɛn taani Yahudiyane sanla nde a fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Nba, maxadena nde yi rafalaxi Yerusalɛn taan yɛxɛɛne so dɛɛn dɛxɔn, a xili “Betesata” Heburu xuini. Gage suulun tixi na maxaden nabilinni. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Furetɔ wuyaxi yi saxi na gagene bun ma, danxutɔne nun sankalatɔne nun lɛbutɛnne. E yi igeni maxa waxatin nan legedenma <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>amasɔtɔ malekana nde yi godoma igeni waxatina nde yi, a yi a yimaxa. Furetɔɔn naxan singe na yi godo igeni, malekana igeni maxama waxatin naxan yi, na furen yi yalanma nɛn, a na findi a sifa yo ra.<verse eid="JHN 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Xɛmɛna nde yi na nun naxan yi furaxi ɲɛɛ tonge saxan e nun solomasɛxɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Yesu to a to saxi na yi, a yi a kolon fa fala na xɛmɛn bata yi bu furaxi, Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I waxi a xɔn ma, i xa kɛndɛya ba?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Furetɔɔn yi a yabi, a naxa, “N kanna, igeni maxan waxatin naxan yi, muxe mi n yii be naxan n nagodɛ igeni. N na kata, n xa godo a yi, muxu gbɛtɛ singe nan godoma n yɛɛ ra.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Keli, i ya sa seen tongo, i siga.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Xɛmɛn yi yalan sa, a yi a sa seen tongo, a siga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Matabu Lɔxɔn nan yi a ra. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Na ma, xɛmɛn naxan kɛndɛyaxi, Yahudiyane yi a fala na xa, e naxa, “Sariyan mi a falaxi i xa i ya sa seen tongo Matabu Lɔxɔni.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.10</char> Farisi muxune namunne mi yi tinɲɛ wali yo xa kɛ <char style="fk">Matabu Lɔxɔni</char>. Na feen sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 20.8-10 kui. Farisi muxune fena ndee saxi sariyan fari, e naxa, a hali muxu sɔxɔlɛxine mi yi maliyɛ na lɔxɔni hali muxune tɔrɔxi na namunna fe ra a xɔdɛxɛn na.</note> <verse eid="JHN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>A yi e yabi, a naxa, “Muxun naxan n nakɛndɛyaxi, na nan a falaxi, a n xa n ma sa seen tongo, n siga.” <verse eid="JHN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>E yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “Nde na ra naxan a falaxi, a i xa i ya sa seen tongo, i siga?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Koni xɛmɛn naxan yi kɛndɛyaxi, na mi yi a kolon, bayo Yesu bata yi lɔ ayi yamaan yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi sa a to Ala Batu Banxini, a naxa, “A mato, i bata kɛndɛya. Fata yulubin ma alogo fe gbɛtɛn nama i sɔtɔ naxan ɲaxu dangu ito ra.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Xɛmɛn yi siga, a sa a fala Yahudiyane xa, a naxa, a Yesu nan a rakɛndɛyaxi. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Nayi, e yi Yesu fen yɛngɛn na, bayo a bata yi na liga Matabu Lɔxɔni.<verse eid="JHN 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Nanara, Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “N Fafe Ala walima waxatin birin, a lan nɛn, n fan xa wali.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Na ma, Yahudiya kuntigine mɔn yi e yixɔdɔxɔ fɛrɛn fendeni Yesu faxa xinla ma. Amasɔtɔ a mi yi Matabu Lɔxɔn sariyan xan gbansan kalama, koni a mɔn yi a falama a a Fafe nan Ala ra, a yi a fala alo e nun Ala keden.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn sɛnbɛna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Nanara, Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa. Fafana a Dii Xɛmɛn mi fefe ligɛ a yɛtɛ ma, fɔ a na a Fafe to naxan ligɛ. N Fafe Ala na naxan liga, n tan a Dii Xɛmɛn fan na nan ligama. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Bayo a Dii Xɛmɛn nafan a ma, a yi a yita a ra a feen naxanye birin ligama. A feene yitama a ra nɛn naxanye gbo itoe xa, alogo ɛ birin xa kabɛ ne ma. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Amasɔtɔ n Fafe Ala faxa muxune rakelima sayani kii naxan yi, a nii rakisin fi e ma, a Dii Xɛmɛn fan nii rakisin fima a waxɔn muxune ma na kii nin. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Fafe Ala mi muxu yo a kiti bolonma koni a bata muxu makitin birin taxu a Dii Xɛmɛn na, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>alogo muxun birin xa a Dii Xɛmɛn binya, alo Fafe Ala binyaxi kii naxan yi. Muxu yo mi a Dii Xɛmɛn binya, na mi Fafan fan binyaxi naxan a xɛxi.”<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>“N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, naxan yo n ma falan mɛ, a dɛnkɛlɛya n xɛ muxun ma, na habadan nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn. Na kanna mi yalagima, koni a bata keli sayani, a so nii rakisini. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, waxatin fama, a bata a li, faxa muxune Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn xuiin namɛma nɛn. Naxanye na a mɛ, ne nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Bayo alo habadan nii rakisin Fafe Ala yii kii naxan yi, a bata a ragidi a Dii Xɛmɛn ma na kiini. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>A bata kiti saan sɛnbɛn fi a Dii Xɛmɛn ma, amasɔtɔ Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn na a ra. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Ɛ nama kabɛ ito ra, bayo waxatin fama faxa muxune birin a xuiin namɛma nɛn, <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>e yi keli e gaburune kui. Naxanye fe faɲin ligaxi, ne kelima nɛn, e nii rakisin sɔtɔ. Naxanye fe ɲaxin ligaxi, ne fan kelima nɛn, e yalagi. <verse eid="JHN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>N mi nɔɛ fefe ligɛ n yɛtɛ ra. N kitin sama nɛn alo n na mɛma kii naxan yi. N ma kitin mɔn tinxin bayo n mi n yɛtɛ sagoon ligama, koni fɔ n xɛ muxun sagona.”<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a sereyane fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>“Xa n tan nan n yɛtɛ sereyaan bama, ɛ mi na yatɛma ɲɔndin na. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Koni muxu gbɛtɛ na naxan sereyaan bama n xa. N na a kolon, a sereyaan naxan bama n ma fe yi, ɲɔndin nan na ra. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>Ɛ bata xɛrane rafa Yoni ma, a seren ba ɲɔndini. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>N tan mako mi adamadiine sereyaan ma koni n na falama nɛn alogo ɛ xa kisi. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yoni luxi nɛn alo lɛnpu dɛgɛna ɛ tagi, a findi kɛnɛnna ra ɛ xa. Ɛ bata tin sɛwɛ a kɛnɛnna ra waxatidi bun. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Koni sereyana n yii naxan gbo Yoni gbeen xa. N Fafe Ala wanla naxanye soxi n yii n xa e rakamali, ne a yitama nɛn a n Fafe nan n xɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Fafe Ala naxan n xɛxi, na fan bata seren ba n xa. Ɛ munma a xuiin mɛ, ɛ mɔn munma a yɛtagin to mumɛ! <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>A falan mi ɛ tan kui, amasɔtɔ ɛ mi dɛnkɛlɛyaxi a xɛraan ma. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Ɛ kitabun fɛsɛfɛsɛma amasɔtɔ ɛ mirixi a ma, a ɛ habadan nii rakisin sɔtɔma a xɔn ma, koni na fan seren bama n tan nan xa! <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Hali na, ɛ mi tinxi fɛ n tan ma, ɛ nii rakisin sɔtɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>“N mako mi adamadiine binyen ma. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Koni n na ɛ tan kolon. Alaa xanuntenyaan mi ɛ bɔɲɛni. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>N bata fa n Fafe Ala xinli koni ɛ mi n nasuxi. Xa muxu gbɛtɛ fa a yɛtɛ xinli, ɛ na tan nasuxuma nɛn. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>A rafan ɛ ma, ɛ xa binyen sɔtɔ ɛ bode ra koni ɛ mi kataxi ɛ yi binyen sɔtɔ Ala keden peen yii. Ɛ dɛnkɛlɛyama na yi di? <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Koni ɛ nama ɛ miri fa fala n na ɛ magima n Fafe xa nɛn. Musa nan ɛ magima, ɛ yigi saxi naxan yi. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Xa ɛ yi laxi Musa ra nun, ɛ yi lama n tan fan na nɛn nun amasɔtɔ a bata n ma fe sɛbɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Koni xa ɛ mi laxi a fe sɛbɛxine ra, ɛ lama n ma falan na di nayi?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi muxu wuli suulun dɛge</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 14.13-21, Maraka 6.30-44, Luka 9.10-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi dangu Galile Daraan kidima, naxan mɔn xili Tiberiyadi Darana. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Yama gbeen yi biraxi a fɔxɔ ra amasɔtɔ e bata yi a kabanako wanle to. A yi furetɔne yiyalanma. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Yesu nun a xarandiine yi te geyaan fari, e sa dɔxɔ na.<verse eid="JHN 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Yahudiyane sanla, Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6.4</char> <char style="fk">Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla:</char> Musaa waxatini, Ala fitina feen nafa nɛn Firawona yamaan ma, malekan yi fa e dii singene birin faxa kɔɛ kedenna ra. Koni, Isirayila kaane yi saraxa wunla xuya e banxine dɛ wudine ma, saya malekan yi dangu e xun ma. Na feen sanla ni ito ra. A mato Xɔrɔyaan 12.1-13 kui.</note> bata yi maso.<verse eid="JHN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Yesu yi a yɛɛn nasiga, a yama gbeen to fɛ a fɛma. A yi a fala Filipi xa, a naxa, “En donseen sarama minɛn yi muxuni itoe xa, e yi e dɛge?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>A na fala a xa nɛn alogo a xa a kɛɲaan fɛsɛfɛsɛ, bayo a yi a kolon a yi naxan ligama. <verse eid="JHN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filipi yi a yabi, a naxa, “Hali en gbeti gbanan kɛmɛ firin sara donseen na, birin mi ndedi sɔtɛ!” <verse eid="JHN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Yesu a xarandiina nde Simɔn Piyɛri ngaxakedenna Andire yi a fala, a naxa, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>“Banxulanna nde be buru xun suulun nun yɛxɛ firin a yii. Koni na nanse ligɛ muxuni itoe birin na?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ yamaan nadɔxɔ.” Nba, sɛxɛn yi mɛnni han. Nayi, muxune birin yi dɔxɔ. Fayida xɛmɛ wuli suulun nan ɲɔxɔn yi e yɛ nun. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Yesu yi buru xunne tongo, a barikan bira Ala xa. Muxun naxanye yi dɔxi na, a yi a taxun ne ra han e wasa! A yɛxɛn fan liga na kiini. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>E birin to lugo, a yi a fala a xarandiine xa, a naxa, “Ɛ dungi dungi dɔnxɛne matongo. Ɛ nama sese yikala.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Nanara, e ne birin matongo. E debe fu nun firin nafe buru xun suulunna dungi dungine ra, naxanye lu e dɛge xanbini.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Na muxune to a to Yesu kabanako feen naxan liga, e yi a fala, e naxa, “Nabiin nan yati xɛmɛni ito ra naxan yi lanma a fa dunuɲa yi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Yesu yi a kolon, a e yi fama a karahanden nin, a xa findi mangan na. Nayi, a mɔn yi keli na, a kedenna yi siga geyaan fari.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi sigan ti igen fari</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 14.22-23, Maraka 6.45-52</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Ɲinbanna a lixina, a xarandiine yi godo daraan dɛ, <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>e te kunkin kui siga daraan kidima Kapɛrunan binni. Kɔɛ yi so, Yesu mi fa e fɛma. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Foye gbeen yi fa, igen yi walanɲɛ ayi kati! <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Na waxatini, xarandiine bata yi siga kilo suulun hanma sennin igen xun ma. E yi Yesu to a masoɛ kunkin na, a sigan tima igen fari. E yi gaxu. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ nama gaxu, n tan nan a ra.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Xarandiine yi tin a so kunkin kui, kunkin yi a sigaden li mafurɛn.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamaan yi Yesu fen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Na xɔtɔn bode yamaan naxan lu daraan dɛ, ne yi a to a kunki keden peen nan yi na yi, anu Yesu mi te na kunkin kui. A xarandiine nan gbansan siga. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Marigi Yesu barikan bira Ala xa dɛnaxan yi, yamaan yi burun don, kunki gbɛtɛye yi fa mɛnni sa keli Tiberiyadi taani. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Nanara, yamana a to waxatin naxan yi, a Yesu nun a xarandiine mi yi na, e te kunkine kui, siga Yesu fendeni Kapɛrunan yi.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu luxi nɛn alo burun naxan findixi nii rakisi seen na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>E Yesu to daraan xanbi ra waxatin naxan yi, e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, i faxi be waxatin mundun yi?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, ɛ mi n fenma amasɔtɔ ɛ bata kabanako feene to, koni bayo ɛ bata burun don, ɛ lugo. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Ɛ nama wali donsena fe ra naxan kalama, fɔ naxan habadan nii rakisin fima ɛ ma n tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn naxan soma ɛ yii. Amasɔtɔ Fafe Ala bata a taxamasenna sa n ma.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>E yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “Nxu tan nanfe ligama alogo nxu yi Alaa wanle kɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ walima Ala xa ikiini: Ɛ xa la a xɛraan na.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “I kabanako feen mundun ligama, nxu a to, nxu dɛnkɛlɛya i ma? I nanfe ligama na yi? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Nxu benbane donseen don nɛn tonbonni naxan xili ‘Manna donsena’ alo a sɛbɛxi Kitabun kui kii naxan yi, a naxa, ‘A burun so e yii sa keli kore, e yi a don.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6.31</char> <char style="fk">Manna donsena:</char> A mato Xɔrɔyaan 16.13-15 nun 16.31 kui.</note> ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Yesu naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa. Musa xa mi burun so ɛ yii de sa keli kore, koni n Fafe Ala nan buru kɛndɛn so ɛ yii, sa keli kore. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Amasɔtɔ Ala burun naxan fima ɛ ma, sa keli kore, na nan nii rakisin fi dunuɲa muxune ma.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Nayi, e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Nxu kanna, lu na burun soɛ nxu yii tun.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N tan nan nii rakisin balon na. Muxu yo fa n tan ma, kamɛn mi na suxɛ mumɛ! Muxu yo dɛnkɛlɛya n tan ma, min xɔnla mi na suxɛ mumɛ! <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Koni n na a fala ɛ xa nɛn, a ɛ bata yi n to nun koni ɛ mi dɛnkɛlɛya. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>N Fafe Ala muxun naxanye fi n ma, ne fama nɛn n fɛma. Naxan na fa n fɛma, n mi na kedɛ mumɛ! <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Amasɔtɔ n godoxi nɛn sa keli ariyanna yi alogo n xa fa n xɛ muxun sagoon liga koni n tan sagoon mi a ra. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>N xɛ muxun sagoon ni i ra: a bata muxun naxanye fi n ma, n nama ne sese ralɔ ayi, koni fɔ n xa e rakeli sayani lɔxɔ dɔnxɛni. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Amasɔtɔ n Fafe Ala sagoon nan ito ra, a naxan yo na a Dii Xɛmɛn to, e dɛnkɛlɛya a ma, n yi e rakeli sayani lɔxɔ dɔnxɛni, ne habadan nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Yahudiyane yi Yesu mafala fɔlɔ bayo a bata a fala, a naxa, “N tan nan balon na naxan sa kelixi ariyanna yi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Na ma, e naxa, “Yusufu a dii xɛmɛn Yesu xa mi ito ra ba? Nxu a fafe nun a nga kolon. A tan a falama di nayi, a godoxi nɛn sa keli ariyanna yi?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ ba n mafalɛ ɛ bode tagi. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Muxu yo mi fɛ n fɛma fɔ n Fafe Ala na naxan mabandun, n xɛ muxuna. Awa, n na a rakelima nɛn sayani lɔxɔ dɔnxɛni. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Nabine bata a sɛbɛ, e naxa, ‘Ala e birin xaranma nɛn.’ Naxan yo na n Fafe Ala xuiin namɛ, a yi a xaranna suxu, na fama nɛn n fɛma. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Muxu yo munma Fafe Ala to, fɔ naxan kelixi Ala yi, na nan tun bata Fafe Ala to. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, muxu yo na dɛnkɛlɛya, na bata habadan nii rakisin sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>N tan nan nii rakisin balon na. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Ɛ benbane burun don nɛn tonbonni, naxan xili Manna donsena, koni e faxa nɛn. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Koni na balon ni i ra naxan sa kelixi ariyanna yi, muxu yo na a don, na mi faxama. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>N tan nan nii rakisin balon na sa keli ariyanna yi. Muxu yo na baloni ito don, a nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn habadan. N fati bɛndɛn nan findixi baloni ito ra, n naxan fima alogo dunuɲa muxune birin xa nii rakisin sɔtɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Yahudiyane xɔlɔxin yi e bode matandi fɔlɔ, e naxa, “Xɛmɛni ito nɔɛ a fati bɛndɛn fiyɛ en ma di, en yi a don?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, xa ɛ mi Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn fati bɛndɛn don, ɛ yi a wunla min, nii rakisin mi luma ɛ xa mumɛ! <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Muxu yo n fati bɛndɛn don, a yi n wunla min, habadan nii rakisina a xa. N na a rakelima nɛn sayani lɔxɔ dɔnxɛni. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Amasɔtɔ donse kɛndɛn nan n fati bɛndɛn na. Min se kɛndɛn nan n wunla ra. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Naxan na n fati bɛndɛn don, a yi n wunla min, na bata lu n tan yi, n fan bata lu na kanni. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Habadan Fafe, na nan n xɛxi. Nii rakisina n tan yii a barakani. Na kiini, naxan na balo n tan xɔn, na fan nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn n barakani. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Baloni ito nan godoxi sa keli ariyanna yi. Ɛ benbane burun don nɛn naxan xili Manna donsena, e faxa. Koni, naxan na baloni ito don, na nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn habadan.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Yesu na birin falaxi waxatin naxan yi, a yi xaranna tima salide banxini Kapɛrunan taani.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Habadan nii rakisina fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>E to na mɛ, a xarandii wuyaxi yi a fala, e naxa, “Xaranni ito xɔdɔxɔ de! Nde tinɲɛ a ma?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Yesu yi a kolon a yɛtɛ ma fa fala a xarandiine a mafalama a falana fe ra. Nanara, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Na falan bata ɛ magaxu ba? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Xa ɛ fa Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn to tɛ a kelideni go? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nan nii rakisin fima. Sese mi fati bɛndɛn na. N falan naxanye tixi ɛ xa, niin nun nii rakisin nan ne ra. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Koni hali na, ɛ tan ndee mi dɛnkɛlɛyaxi.” Amasɔtɔ xabu a fɔlɔni, Yesu yi ne kolon naxanye mi yi dɛnkɛlɛyaxi a ma e nun naxan sa a yanfama. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>A mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Na feen ma, n bata a fala ɛ xa, n naxa, ‘Muxu yo mi nɔɛ fɛ n fɛma fɔ n Fafe Ala na naxan mali.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>A xarandii wuyaxi yi xɛtɛ a fɔxɔ ra na waxatini, e mi fa siga a fɔxɔ ra sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JHN 6:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Nanara, Yesu yi a fala a xarandii fu nun firinne xa, a naxa, “Ɛ tan go, ɛ fan waxi xɛtɛ feni ba?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simɔn Piyɛri yi a yabi, a naxa, “Marigina, nxu sigama nde fɛma? Habadan nii rakisi falane i tan nan yii. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Nxu bata dɛnkɛlɛya, nxu bata a kolon fa fala i tan nan Alaa Muxu Sariɲanxin na.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “N tan xa mi ɛ tan muxu fu nun firinne sugandixi ba? Koni hali na, muxu keden ɛ yɛ, se ɲaxin nan na ra!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>A yi na falama Simɔn Isakariyoti a dii xɛmɛn Yudasi nan ma. Na yi a xarandii fu nun firinne nan yɛ, koni na nan yi a yanfama.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nun a ngaxakedenne fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi Galile yamanani siga. A mi tin sigɛ Yudaya yamanani amasɔtɔ Yahudiyan naxanye yi na, ne yi waxi a faxa feni. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Yahudiyane Bubu Kui Sanla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.2</char> <char style="fk">Bubu Kui Sanla</char> fe sɛbɛxi Saraxaraline 23.33-38 kui.</note> bata yi maso. <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Nanara, Yesu ngaxakedenne yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “I lan nɛn i xa keli be, i siga Yudaya yamanani, alogo i ya xarandiine xa i ya kabanako fe wanle to. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Muxun wanla naxan kɛma, a mi na luxunɲɛ xa a waxi findi feni xili kanna ra. Bayo i feni itoe ligama, i yɛtɛ yita dunuɲa birin na.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Amasɔtɔ hali a ngaxakedenne mi yi laxi a ra. <verse eid="JHN 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N ma waxatin munma a li singen. Koni waxatin birin lan ɛ tan xa. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Dunuɲa mi nɔɛ ɛ tan naɲaxuɛ. Koni a bata n tan naɲaxu, amasɔtɔ n bata a fala a a kɛwanle ɲaxu. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Ɛ siga sanli. N tan mi sigama iki, amasɔtɔ n ma waxatin munma a li singen.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>A yi na fala e xa, a lu Galile yamanani.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi siga yamaan malanni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Yesu ngaxakedenne sigaxin sanli, na xanbi ra a fan yi siga. Koni a mi a yɛtɛ makɛnɛn, a yi a yɛɛ raluxunɲɛ ayi.<verse eid="JHN 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Yahudiyane yi a fen malanni, e naxa, “A minɛn yi?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Yamaan yi kɔyɛkɔyɛnma a fe yi han! Nde naxa, “Muxu faɲin nan a ra.” Nde fan naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn, a yamaan mayendenma.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Koni muxu yo mi falan ti kɛnɛnni a fe ma, amasɔtɔ e yi gaxuxi Yahudiyane yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Malanna bata yi siga han a tagi, Yesu yi siga Ala Batu Banxini, a yamaan xaran fɔlɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Yahudiyane yi kabɛ kati! E yi a fala, e naxa, “Xɛmɛni ito Kitabun kolonxi di? A mi xaranxi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “N xaranna naxan tima, na mi kelixi n tan ma, koni a kelixi n xɛ muxun nan ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Naxan waxi Ala sagoon liga feni, na a kolonma nɛn, xa xaranni ito kelixi Ala nan ma, hanma xa a kelixi n tan nan ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Muxun naxan a yɛtɛ a fe falama, na binyen nan fenma a yɛtɛ xa. Koni naxan binyen fenma a xɛ muxun xa, na ɲɔndin nan falama, tinxintareya mi na kanni. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Musa xa mi Alaa sariyan so ɛ yii ba? Koni ɛ sese mi sariyan suxi! Nanfera ɛ kataxi n faxa feen na?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Yamaan yi a yabi, e naxa, “Yinnani i fɔxɔ ra! Nde kataxi i tan faxa feen na?” <verse eid="JHN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “N bata yi kabanako fe gbee keden liga, ɛ birin kabɛ nɛn na ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Musa gaan tiin yamarin so nɛn ɛ yii. Nanara, ɛ ɛ dii xɛmɛne dugi soma Matabu Lɔxɔni. Anu, Musa xa mi a fɔlɔ koni xabu ɛ benbane. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Xa ɛ ɛ dii xɛmɛne dugi soma Matabu Lɔxɔni, alogo Musaa sariyan nama kala, ɛ xɔlɔma n tan ma nanfera, a n bata xɛmɛn gbindin birin nakɛndɛya Matabu Lɔxɔni? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Ɛ nama kitin bolon benun ɛ xa feen fɛsɛfɛsɛ. Ɛ kitin sa tinxinna nin.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamaan yi Yesu a fe fala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Yerusalɛn taan muxuna ndee yi a fala, e naxa, “Na xɛmɛn xa mi ito ra ba, e kataxi naxan faxa fe ra? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>A mato, a falan tima kɛnɛnni, e mi a mafalama! Kuntigine bata a kolon ba, fa fala Alaa Muxu Sugandixin nan ito ra? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Koni Alaa Muxu Sugandixin na fa waxatin naxan yi, muxu yo mi a keliden kolonɲɛ. Koni en birin xɛmɛni ito keliden kolon.” <verse eid="JHN 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Yesu yi xaranna tima Ala Batu Banxini waxatin naxan yi, a yi a xuini te, a naxa, “Ɛ n kolon ba e nun n keliden yɛtɛna? N mi faxi n yɛtɛ ma. Naxan n xɛxi, ɲɔndin nan na kanna ra. Ɛ mi a tan kolon, <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>koni n tan a kolon, amasɔtɔ n kelixi a tan nan fɛma. A tan nan n xɛxi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Na xanbi ra, e kata a suxu feen na. Koni muxu yo mi a yiin din a ra, amasɔtɔ a waxatin munma yi a li singen.<verse eid="JHN 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Koni muxu wuyaxi yi dɛnkɛlɛya a ma yamaan yɛ, e naxa, “Alaa Muxu Sugandixin na fa waxatin naxan yi, a kabanako feene ligɛ nɛn naxanye gbo muxuni ito gbeene xa ba?” <verse eid="JHN 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Farisi muxune yi yamaan kɔyɛkɔyɛn xuiin mɛ Yesu a fe ma. Saraxarali kuntigine nun Farisi muxune yi kantan muxune rasiga a suxudeni.<verse eid="JHN 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yesu naxa, “N na ɛ fɛma han waxatidi mɔn, na xanbi ra n siga n xɛ muxun fɛma. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Ɛ n fenma nɛn, koni ɛ mi fa n toɛ sɔnɔn, amasɔtɔ n sigan dɛnaxan yi, ɛ mi nɔɛ sigɛ na yi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Yahudiyane yi a fala e bode tagi, e naxa, “A sigan minɛn yi, en mi a toɛ dɛnaxan yi? A sigama Girɛkine yamanani ba, en kon kaane xuyaxi ayi dɛnaxan yi, a yi Girɛkine xaran? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>A falani ito bunna di? Fa fala, ɛ n fenma nɛn, koni ɛ mi n toɛ? Fa fala, n sigan dɛnaxan yi, ɛ mi sigɛ mɛnni?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Igen naxan habadan nii rakisin fima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Sanla lɔxɔ dɔnxɛni, sanla lɔxɔ gbeena, Yesu yi ti, a yi a xuini te, a naxa, “Xa min xɔnla naxan ma, a xa fa n ma, a fa a min. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Naxan na dɛnkɛlɛya n tan ma, siimaya igene minima nɛn na kanni alo baana, alo Kitabuna a falaxi kii naxan yi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.38</char> <char style="fk">Siimaya igena</char> fe mɔn sɛbɛxi Sakari 14.8 kui.</note> <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Yesu yi Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nan ma fe falama. Naxanye yi dɛnkɛlɛyama Yesu ma, ne yi a sɔtɔma nɛn. Na waxatini, Nii Sariɲanxin munma yi fi, amasɔtɔ Yesu munma yi keli a binyeni.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamaan yi yitaxun Yesu a fe ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Muxuna ndee yi Yesu xuiin mɛ yamaan yɛ, e naxa, “Nabi yɛtɛɛn nan xɛmɛni ito ra yati!” <verse eid="JHN 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Nde gbɛtɛye fan naxa, “Alaa Muxu Sugandixin nan a ra.” Koni nde gbɛtɛye naxa, “Alaa Muxu Sugandixin minima Galile yamanani di? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Kitabun xa mi a falaxi ba fa fala Alaa Muxu Sugandixin minima Dawuda bɔnsɔnna nin keli Bɛtɛlɛmi taani, Dawuda dɔxɔdena?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.42</char> A mato Samuyɛli Firinden 7.12 nun Yaburin 89.4-5 nun Yeremi 23.5 nun Mika 5.1 kui.</note> <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Nanara, yamaan yi yitaxunxi a fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Ndee yi waxi a suxu feni koni muxu yo mi a yiin din a ra.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yahudiya kuntigine dɛnkɛlɛyatareyana fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Kantan muxune yi xɛtɛ saraxarali kuntigine nun Farisi muxune fɛma, naxanye e maxɔdin, e naxa, “Nanfera ɛ mi faxi Yesu ra?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Kantan muxune yi e yabi, e naxa, “Muxu yo munma falan ti singen alo xɛmɛni ito falan tima kii naxan yi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Farisi muxune yi e maxɔdin, e naxa, “A bata ɛ fan mayenden n ɲɛ? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Ɛ yamaan kuntigina nde kolon hanma Farisi muxuna nde naxan laxi a ra? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Yamani ito mi Musaa sariyan kolon. Nanara, Ala dangana e fɔxɔ ra!” <verse eid="JHN 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Nikodɛmi naxan bata yi fa Yesu fɛma a fɔlɔni nun, na yi e yɛ, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>“En ma sariyan na a ra ba, en xa muxun yalagi benun en xa a xuiin mɛ, en yi a kolon a naxan ligama?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Galile kaan nan i tan fan na ba? Kitabun xaran. I a kolonma nɛn nayi a nabiin mi kelɛ Galile yamanani mumɛ!” <verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Nayi, birin yi siga a konni.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Ɲaxanla naxan suxu yalunyani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Yesu yi siga Oliwi geyaan fari. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Na xɔtɔn bode subaxani, a mɔn yi xɛtɛ Ala Batu Banxini. Yamaan birin yi fa a fɛma, a dɔxɔ, a yi e xaran fɔlɔ.<verse eid="JHN 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Sariya karamɔxɔne nun Farisi muxune yi ɲaxanla nde suxu yalunyaan ligadeni, e fa a ra, e yi a ti e tagi. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>E yi a fala Yesu xa, e naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, nxu ɲaxanli ito suxi yalunyaan nan ligɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Musa a yamari nɛn Sariya Kitabuni, a na ɲaxalan sifan xa magɔlɔn gɛmɛn na han a faxa. Nba, i tan naxa a di?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>E yi na falama a bunba feen nan ma, alogo e xa a suxu. Koni Yesu yi a yigodo, a lu sɛbɛnla tiyɛ a yii sonla ra bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>E yi tixi a dɛxɔn ma na waxatini, e lu a maxɔdinɲɛ. Yesu yi a rakeli, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Naxan munma yulubin liga ɛ tagi singen, na singe xa gɛmɛn woli a ma.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>A mɔn yi a yigodo, a lu sɛbɛnla tiyɛ bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>E ito mɛ waxatin naxan yi, e birin yi keli na yi keden keden yɛɛn ma fɔlɔ xɛmɛ fonne ma. Yesu kedenna yi lu na yi, ɲaxanla fan yi lu tixi na yi. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Yesu yi keli, a yi a fala ɲaxanla xa, a naxa, “Nga ɲaxanla, e minɛn yi? Muxe mi lu be, e yi i yalagi?” <verse eid="JHN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>A yi a yabi, a naxa, “N fafe, muxu yo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesu naxa, “Nba, n tan fan mi i yalagima. Siga, koni i nama fa yulubin liga sɔnɔn.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dunuɲa kɛnɛnna nan Yesu ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Yesu mɔn yi falan ti e xa, a naxa, “N tan nan dunuɲa kɛnɛnna ra. Naxan na bira n tan fɔxɔ ra, na nii rakisin kɛnɛnna sɔtɔma nɛn, a mi sigan tiyɛ dimini mumɛ!”<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Farisi muxune yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “I yɛtɛ seren nan bama iki, ɲɔndi mi i ya sereyaan na!” <verse eid="JHN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Hali n nan n yɛtɛ seren ba, n ɲɔndin nan falama. Amasɔtɔ n na n keliden nun n sigaden kolon. Koni ɛ tan mi n keliden nun n sigaden kolon. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Ɛ kitin sama adamadiyaan nin. N mi muxu yo a kiti bolonma. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Koni xa n tan na kitin sa, n ma kitisaan findima ɲɔndin nan na, amasɔtɔ n keden mi a ra. Nxu nun n fafe na a ra naxan n xɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>A sɛbɛxi ɛ sariyan kui, a naxa, ‘Xa sere firinna falan naxan ti, ɲɔndin nan na ra.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.17</char> A mato Sariyane 17.6 nun 19.15 kui.</note> <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>N seren bama n yɛtɛ xa, n Fafe naxan n xɛxi, na fan seren bama n xa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>E yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “I fafe minɛn yi?” Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ mi n kolon, ɛ mi n Fafe fan kolon. Xa ɛ yi n tan kolon nun, ɛ yi n Fafe fan kolonma nɛn.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Yesu yi na falane birin tima, a lu xaranna tiyɛ Ala Batu Banxini, Alaa kiseene rasuxuma dɛnaxan yi. Hali na, muxu yo mi a suxu, amasɔtɔ a waxatin munma yi a li singen.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu sigama dɛnaxan yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Yesu mɔn yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N bata siga. Ɛ n fenma nɛn, koni ɛ faxama nɛn ɛ yulubine yi. N sigama dɛnaxan yi, ɛ mi nɔɛ sigɛ mɛnni.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Nanara, Yahudiyane yi maxɔdinna ti, e naxa, “A waxi a yɛtɛ faxa feen nin ba, bayo a falama, a naxa, ‘N sigama dɛnaxan yi, ɛ mi nɔɛ fɛ mɛnni?’ ” <verse eid="JHN 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Dunuɲa gbeen nan ɛ tan na, koni n tan kelixi kore xɔnna nan ma. Ɛ tan fataxi dunuɲa ito nan na, koni n tan mi kelixi dunuɲa ito yi. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Nanara, n na a falaxi ɛ xa fa fala, ɛ faxama nɛn ɛ yulubine yi. Nba, xa ɛ mi laxi a ra fa fala ‘N tan nan a ra, naxan na yi,’ ɛ faxama nɛn ɛ yulubine yi yati!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.24 </char> A sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 3.14 kui fa fala Ala xinla yɛtɛɛn findixi na falan nan na bayo Ala naxa mɛnni, “N tan na a ra, Ala naxan na yi.” Ala mɔn naxa mɛnni fa fala a yɛtɛɛn xili nɛn “N Na Yi.” Nayi, Yesu a falani ito bunna nɛn fa fala Yesu findixi Alaa falan nan na, falan naxan findixi Ala ra. Na feen mɔn sɛbɛxi Yoni 1.1 kui.</note> <verse eid="JHN 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>E yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “Nde i tan na?” Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “N naxan falama ɛ xa xabu a fɔlɔni, na nan n tan na. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Fala wuyaxi n xɔn ɛ kitideni, koni naxan n nafaxi, ɲɔndin nan a tan na. N naxan mɛxi a ra, n na falama nɛn dunuɲa muxune xa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>E mi yi a famuma fa fala a Fafe Ala nan ma fe falama e xa. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Nanara, Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ na Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛni te<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.28</char> <char style="fk">Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛni te</char> fena: A mato Yoni 3.14 kui. Yesu <char style="fk">yite</char> nɛn a yelin xanbini gbangbanɲɛ wudin ma. A mɔn yi <char style="fk">te</char> ariyanna yi. Yesu falan tima na fe firinna nan ma.</note> waxatin naxan yi, ɛ a kolonma nɛn na yi fa fala ‘N tan nan a ra, naxan na yi.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.28</char> A mato Xɔrɔyaan 3.14 kui. </note> Ɛ a kolonma nɛn na waxatini, n mi fefe ligama n yɛtɛ ma fɔ n Fafe Ala n xaranxi naxan ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Naxan n xɛxi, na n fɔxɔ ra, a mi n kedenna luxi, amasɔtɔ n na a rafan feen ligama waxatin birin.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Muxu wuyaxi yi a falane mɛ, e dɛnkɛlɛya a ma.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲɔndina i xɔrɔyama nɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Na ma, Yahudiyan naxanye yi dɛnkɛlɛyaxi a ma, Yesu yi a fala ne xa, a naxa, “Xa ɛ n ma xaranna suxu, n ma xarandiin yɛtɛɛn nan ɛ tan na na yi. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Ɛ ɲɔndin kolonma nɛn, ɲɔndin yi ɛ xɔrɔya.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Iburahima bɔnsɔnna nan nxu tan na. Han to, nxu mi yi muxe konyiya bun. Fa fala, ɛ xɔrɔyama nɛn, na bunna di?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, naxanye yulubin ligama, yulubina konyin nan ne ra. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Konyin mi luma denbayani waxatin birin, koni dii xɛmɛn luma nɛn denbayani habadan. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Xa Dii Xɛmɛna ɛ xɔrɔya, ɛ bata xɔrɔya nayi yati! <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>N na a kolon Iburahima bɔnsɔnna nan ɛ tan na. Anu, ɛ kataxi n faxa feen na amasɔtɔ n ma falan mi xanma ɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>N naxan toxi n Fafe Ala fɛma, n na nan falama ɛ xa, koni ɛ naxan mɛxi ɛ fafe ra, ɛ na nan ligama.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nxu fafe nan Iburahima ra.” Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Xa Iburahimaa diine nan yi ɛ ra nun, ɛ yi a liga feene ligama nɛn. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>N ɲɔndin naxan mɛxi Ala ra, n na nan falama ɛ xa, koni hali na, ɛ kataxi n faxa feen na. Iburahima mi ito ɲɔxɔnna ligɛ! <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Ɛ fafe liga feene nan ligama.” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nxu mi barixi futun fari ma. Ala nan keden peen nxu Fafe ra.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Xa ɛ fafe nan yi Ala ra nun yati, ɛ yi n xanuma nɛn nun, amasɔtɔ n fataxi Ala nan na, n be nin iki. N mi faxi n yɛtɛ ra, Ala nan n xɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>N naxan falama, nanfera ɛ mi na yɛɛ toma? Amasɔtɔ ɛ mi nɔɛ n fala xuiin mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Ɛ fafe nan Yinna Manga Setana ra, ɛ waxi a xɔn ma, ɛ xa a rafan feene liga. Xabu a fɔlɔni muxu faxan nan a tan na. A mi tin ɲɔndin ma amasɔtɔ ɲɔndi mi a tan yi mumɛ! A nɛɛn wulen falama, a minima a yɛtɛ gbee kɛɲaan nan ma amasɔtɔ wule xɛlɛn nan a ra. Wulene birin fafe nan a tan na. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Koni ɛ mi laxi n na bayo n ɲɔndin nan falama ɛ xa. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Nde ɛ yɛ be naxan a yitɛ a n bata yulubin liga? Xa n ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, nanfera ɛ mi lama n na? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Naxan fataxi Ala ra, na a tuli matima nɛn Alaa falan na. Ɛ mi ɛ tuli matima bayo Ala gbee mi ɛ tan na.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nun Iburahima fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Yahudiyane yi Yesu yabi, e naxa, “Nxu mi ɲɔndin xan falan ba, fa fala Samariya kaan nan i tan na ɲinan ɲaxin naxan fɔxɔ ra?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.48</char> Na waxatini Yahudiyane yi <char style="fk">Samariya kaane</char> yatɛxi kafirine nan na. E fe fɔlɔden sɛbɛxi Mangane Firinden 17.24 kui.</note> <verse eid="JHN 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Yinnan mi n tan fɔxɔ ra. N na n Fafe Ala nan tun binyama, koni ɛ tan n yelefuma. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>N mi binyen fenma n yɛtɛ xa. Ala naxan kitin sama, na nan binyen fenma n tan xa. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, naxan na n ma falan suxu, na kanna mi sayaan sɔtɛ habadan!”<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Yahudiyane yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Nxu bata a kolon yati, fa fala yinnana i tan fɔxɔ ra! Iburahima bata faxa, nabine fan bata faxa, koni i tan naxa, ‘Naxan na n ma falan suxu, na kanna mi sayaan sɔtɛ habadan.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>I tan gbo nxu fafe Iburahima xa ba, naxan bata faxa? Nabine fan bata faxa. I ya fe mirixi di?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Xa n yi n yɛtɛ binya nun, n ma binyen mi findima sese ra. N Fafe nan n binyama, ɛ a falaxi naxan ma fa fala ɛ Ala nan a ra. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Ɛ mi a tan kolon, koni n tan a kolon. Xa n na a fala fa fala n mi a kolon, n bata findi wule xɛlɛn na nayi alo ɛ tan. Koni n na a kolon, n na a falan suxuma. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Ɛ fafe Iburahima yengi yi tixi n fa waxatin na sɛwani. A bata a to, a yi sɛwa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Yahudiyane yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “I munma ɲɛɛ tonge suulun sɔtɔ singen, i yi Iburahima to nun ba?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, Iburahima barixi nɛn, n tan na yi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu a alayana a fe falaxi wundoni yireni ito yi. Na feen mɔn sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 3.14 kui, na naxa fa fala Ala xinla yɛtɛɛn findixi na falan nan na bayo Ala naxa mɛnni, “N tan na a ra, Ala naxan na yi.” Ala mɔn naxa mɛnni fa fala a yɛtɛɛn xili nɛn “N Na Yi.” Nayi, Yesu to a falama muxune xa fa fala “Iburahima barixi nɛn, n tan na yi,” na bunna nɛn fa fala Yesu findixi Alaa falan na, falan naxan findixi Ala ra. Na feen mɔn sɛbɛxi Yoni 1.1 kui.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Na ma, e yi gɛmɛne tongo a magɔlɔn xinla ma, koni Yesu yi a luxun, a mini Ala Batu Banxini.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi danxutɔɔn yɛɛn nabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Yesu yi a masiga tima waxatin naxan yi, a yi xɛmɛna nde to naxan barixi danxutɔyani. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>A xarandiine yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, nanfera xɛmɛni ito barixi danxutɔyani, a yɛtɛɛn nan yulubin ligaxi ba hanma a sɔtɔ muxune?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “A yɛtɛna yulubin xa mi a danxuxi, a sɔtɔ muxune fan gbeen mi a danxuxi. A danxuxi nɛn alogo Ala sɛnbɛn wanla xa mayita yamaan na a tan xɔn ma. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Fanni sogen texi fɔ en xa n xɛ muxuna wanle kɛ nɛn. Amasɔtɔ kɔɛɛn somaan ni i ra, muxe mi nɔɛ walɛ waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>N dunuɲa yi waxatin naxan yi, dunuɲa kɛnɛnna nan n tan na.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Yesu to na fala, a dɛgen namini bɔxɔni, a bɛndɛn namulan a ra, a boron bɔli danxutɔɔn yɛɛne ma. <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>A yi a fala xɛmɛn xa, a naxa, “Sa i yɛɛn naxa ige ramaradeni naxan xili Siloyan.” Siloyan bunna nɛɛn, “Xɛrana.” Na ma, xɛmɛn yi siga, a sa a yɛɛn naxa. A xɛtɛmatɔna, a seen to.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Na xanbi ra, a dɔxɔ bodene nun muxun naxanye yi a toma xandi tideni a fɔlɔni, ne yi maxɔdinna ti, e naxa, “Xɛmɛn naxan yi dɔxi xandi tideni nun, na xa mi ito ra ba?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Nde naxa, “A tan nan a ra.” Koni bonne naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn, e maliga nɛn tun!” Koni xɛmɛn yɛtɛɛn yi a fala, a naxa, “N tan nan yati a ra.” <verse eid="JHN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>E yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “I yɛɛn nabixi di?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>A yi e yabi, a naxa, “Xɛmɛn naxan xili Yesu, na nan bɛndɛn namulanxi a yi boron bɔli n yɛɛne ma. A yi a fala n xa, a naxa, ‘Siga Siloyan yi, i sa i yɛɛn naxa.’ Nayi, n sa n yɛɛn naxa, n yi seen to.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>E yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “Na xɛmɛn minɛn yi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">A yi e yabi, a naxa, “N mi a kolon.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Farisi muxune yi danxutɔɔn maxɔdin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Nba, xɛmɛn naxan yi danxuxi nun, e yi siga na ra Farisi muxune fɛma. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Anu, Yesu bɛndɛn namulan waxatin naxan yi, a xɛmɛn yɛɛne rabi, Matabu Lɔxɔn nan yi a ra. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Nanara, Farisi muxune mɔn yi xɛmɛn maxɔdin a yɛɛn nabi kiin ma. A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “A bɛndɛn nan namulanxi, a yi a bɔli n yɛɛne ma, n yi n yɛɛn naxa, iki n bata seen to.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Farisi muxuna nde naxa, “Xɛmɛn naxan ito ligaxi, na mi fataxi Ala xan na, amasɔtɔ a mi Matabu Lɔxɔn tɔnna suxi.” Koni nde gbɛtɛ naxa, “Yulubi kanna nɔɛ kabanako fe sifani itoe ligɛ ba?” Na ma, e yitaxun. <verse eid="JHN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Nba, Farisi muxune mɔn yi xɛmɛn maxɔdin, e naxa, “I tan naxa a di a fe yi, a i tan naxan yɛɛye rabixi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">A yi e yabi, a naxa, “Nabiin nan a ra.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Benun e xa xɛmɛn sɔtɔ muxune xili, Yahudiyane mɔn mi yi laxi a ra a danxutɔɔn nan yi a ra, a bata seen to. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>E yi e maxɔdin, e naxa, “Ɛ diin nan ito ra ba, ɛ naxan ma a a sɔtɔxi danxutɔyaan nin? Nanfe ligaxi a to fa seen toma iki?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>A sɔtɔ muxune yi e yabi, e naxa, “Nxu a kolon fa fala a nxɔ diin na a ra. Nxu mɔn a kolon a sɔtɔxi danxutɔyaan nin. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Koni nxu mi a kolon naxan a ligaxi a fa seen toma iki. Naxan a yɛɛn nabixi, nxu mi na fan kolon. Ɛ a maxɔdin, bayo dii ɲɔrɛ mi fa a ra sɔnɔn. A yɛtɛɛn xa ɛ yabi!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>A sɔtɔ muxune ito fala nɛn, amasɔtɔ e yi gaxuxi Yahudiyane yɛɛ ra, bayo Yahudiyane bata yi lan a ma fa fala naxan na a tiyɛ a ra, a Alaa Muxu Sugandixin nan Yesu ra, e na kanna kedima nɛn salide banxini. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Na nan a liga, a sɔtɔ muxune naxa, “Ɛ a maxɔdin, amasɔtɔ dii ɲɔrɛ mi fa a ra sɔnɔn!”<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>E mɔn yi na xɛmɛn xili naxan yi danxuxi, e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Ɲɔndin fala, i binyen fi Ala ma! Nxu a kolon fa fala yulubi kanna nan na xɛmɛn na.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Xɛmɛn yi e yabi, a naxa, “N tan mi a kolon xa yulubi kanna nan a ra. N naxan kolon, danxutɔɔn nan yi n na, koni iki n seen toma!” <verse eid="JHN 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>E yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “A nanfe ligaxi i ra? A i yɛɛn nabixi di?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>A yi e yabi, a naxa, “N bata yelin na falɛ ɛ xa, koni ɛ mi ɛ tuli mati. Nanfera ɛ mɔn waxi a mɛ feni? Ɛ fan waxi findi feni a xarandiine nan na ba?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>E yi a makonbi, e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “A xarandiina i tan nan na, Musa gbee xarandiine nan nxu tan na. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Nxu a kolon fa fala Ala falan ti nɛn Musa xa, koni nxu mi xɛmɛni ito kelide kolon!” <verse eid="JHN 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Xɛmɛn yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ee! Nba, kabanako feen nan na ra, ɛ mi a keliden kolon, koni a bata n tan yɛɛn nabi. <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>En na a kolon fa fala Ala mi a tuli matima yulubi kanne ra. A tuli matima a binya muxu nan xui ra naxan a sagoon ligama. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Xabu dunuɲa da, muxe munma a mɛ singen fa fala muxuna nde bata danxutɔɔn yɛɛn nabi naxan sɔtɔxi danxutɔyani. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Xa xɛmɛni ito mi fataxi Ala xan na nun, a mi yi nɔɛ fefe ligɛ nun.” <verse eid="JHN 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “I sɔtɔxi yulubin yɛtɛɛn nin, i kataxi nxu xaran feen nan na ba?” E yi a kedi tanden ma.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Danxutɔyana Alaa feene yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Yesu yi a mɛ fa fala a e bata xɛmɛn kedi. A yi a to, a naxa, “I bata dɛnkɛlɛya Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn ma ba?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Xɛmɛn yi a yabi, a naxa, “N kanna, nde na ra alogo n xa dɛnkɛlɛya a ma?” <verse eid="JHN 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I bata yelin a toɛ, a tan nan falan tima i xa iki.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Xɛmɛn yi a fala, a naxa, “N Marigina, n bata dɛnkɛlɛya i ma.” A yi a xinbi sin Yesu bun ma.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Yesu naxa, “N faxi dunuɲa makitiden nin alogo danxutɔne xa seen to, yɛɛ kanne yi danxu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Farisi muxuna ndee yi a fɛma na yi, ne yi a xuiin mɛ. E yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “I yengi a ma danxutɔɔn nan nxu tan fan na ba?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Xa danxutɔɔn nan yi ɛ ra nun, ɛ mi yi yatɛma yulubi kanna ra na yi. Koni bayo ɛ naxa, ‘Nxu seen toma,’ ɛ yulubin luma nɛn ɛ ma na yi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yɛxɛɛ kulana fe sandana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Yesu naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, muxun naxan mi soma xuruse sansanni fata a so dɛɛn na, koni a te sansanna ra, muɲaden nun mafu tiin nan na kanna ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Muxun naxan soma xuruse sansanni fata a dɛɛn na, xuruse rabaan nan na kanna ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Dɛ kantanna dɛɛn nabima a xa nɛn. A na a yɛxɛɛne xili waxatin naxan yi, e a xuiin mɛma nɛn, a yi e ramini. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>A na a gbeene ramini waxatin naxan yi, a ti e yɛɛ ra, a yɛxɛɛne birama a fɔxɔ ra nɛn, amasɔtɔ e a xuiin kolon. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>E mi birama muxu gbɛtɛ fɔxɔ ra, e gima muxu gbɛtɛ yɛɛ ra nɛn, amasɔtɔ e mi a xuiin kolon.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yesu yi sandani ito sa e xa, koni a feen naxan falama e xa, e mi na famu.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu, xuruse raba faɲina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Nayi, Yesu mɔn yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, n tan nan sansanna so dɛɛn na yɛxɛɛne xa. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Naxanye birin faxi n yɛɛ ra, muɲadene nun mafu tiine nan yi ne ra. Koni yɛxɛɛne mi e tuli mati ne xuine ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>N tan nan sansanna so dɛɛn na. Muxu yo so n tan xɔn ma, na kisima nɛn. Na nɔɛ minɛ nɛn a so, a yi balon sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Muɲaden mi fama fefe ra fɔ muɲan nun faxa tiin nun kalan xili ma. N tan faxi nɛn alogo e xa dunuɲa yi gidi dɛfexin sɔtɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>“N tan nan xuruse raba faɲin na. Xuru se raba faɲin tinɲɛ nɛn, a faxa yɛxɛɛne fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Koni walikɛɛn tan mi luxi alo xuruse rabana bayo a gbee mi yɛxɛɛne ra. Xa a kankon to fɛ, a yɛxɛɛne rabeɲinma nɛn, a yi a gi. Kankon yi wuru yɛxɛɛ kuruni a yi e raxuya ayi. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Walikɛɛn nan na ra, yɛxɛɛne fe kɔntɔfili mi a ma. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>N tan nan xuruse raba faɲin na. N na n ma xuruseene kolon, e fan n kolon <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>alo Fafana n kolon kii naxan yi, alo n fan Fafan kolon kii naxan yi. N nan n niin fima nɛn n ma xuruseene fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Yɛxɛɛ gbɛtɛye n yii naxanye mi kulani ito yi fɔ n xa fa ne fan na. E tuli matima nɛn n xuiin na. E findi kuru kedenna ra xuruse raba kedenna xa. <verse eid="JHN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>N Fafe Ala bata n xanu amasɔtɔ n bata n niin fi, alogo n mɔn xa sa a sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Muxu yo mi n niin bɛ n yi, koni n na a fima nɛn n yɛtɛ ra. Sɛnbɛna n yii, n yi a fi, a sɛnbɛn mɔn n yii, n yi a tongo. N yamarini ito nan sɔtɔxi n Fafe Ala ra.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Yahudiyane mɔn yi yitaxun na falane fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>E wuyaxi yi a fala, e naxa, “Yinna ɲaxin nan ito fɔxɔ ra. Seen bata so a yi! Ɛ tuli matima a ra nanfera?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Koni bonne naxa, “Yinna ɲaxin naxan fɔxɔ ra, na mi falan tima na kiini. Yinnan nɔɛ danxutɔɔn yɛɛn nabiyɛ ba?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yahudiyane yi e mɛ Yesu ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Ala Batu Banxin nabi waxatin sanla sɛwan nan yi a ra Yerusalɛn taani, xunbeli waxatini. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yesu yi a masiga tima Ala Batu Banxin tanden ma Sulemani a Gagene bun ma. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Yahudiyane yi a rabilin, e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “I sikɛni ito bama nxu ma waxatin mundun yi? Xa Alaa Muxu Sugandixin nan i tan na, a fala nxu xa kɛnɛnni.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “N bata yelin a falɛ ɛ xa, koni ɛ mi laxi a ra. N kabanako fe wanla naxanye kɛma n Fafe Ala sɛnbɛni, ne nan n seren na. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Koni ɛ mi laxi n na, amasɔtɔ n ma yɛxɛɛne mi ɛ tan na. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>N ma yɛxɛɛne n xuiin mɛma nɛn. N na e kolon, e birama nɛn n fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>N habadan nii rakisin fima e ma nɛn, e mi faxɛ habadan. Muxu yo mi nɔɛ e bɛ n yii. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>N Fafe Ala naxan e soxi n yii, na gbo birin xa. Muxu yo mi nɔɛ e bɛ n Fafe Ala yii. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>N tan nun n Fafe, keden nan nxu ra.” <verse eid="JHN 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Yahudiyane mɔn yi gɛmɛne tongo a magɔlɔn xinla ma.<verse eid="JHN 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N bata wali faɲi wuyaxi kɛ ɛ yɛtagi n Fafe Ala barakani. Ɛ n magɔlɔnma wanla mundun ma fe ra ne yɛ nayi?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Yahudiyane yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nxu mi i magɔlɔnma wali faɲine xan ma fe ra fɔ i Ala rayelefun naxan tima! Bayo muxun nan tun i tan na, koni i kataxi i xa i yɛtɛ findi Ala ra!” <verse eid="JHN 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “A mi sɛbɛxi ɛ sariyani ba, a Ala naxa, ‘Alane nan ɛ tan na’?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.34</char> Yaburin 82.6</note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Kitabun naxan falaxi ɲɔndin nan na ra habadan. Alaa falan tixi muxun naxanye xa, xa a yi a fala ne ma, a ‘alane’ nan ne ra, <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>nanfera ɛ tan naxa, a n tan bata Ala rayelefu n to a falaxi a Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn nan n tan na? N Fafe Ala nan n sugandixi, a yi n nafa dunuɲa yi. <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Awa, xa n mi Fafe Alaa wanla kɛma hali ɛ mi la n na. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Koni xa n na e kɛma, xa ɛ mi la n na, ɛ la n ma wanle ra alogo ɛ xa a kolon fa, a Fafana n yi e nun n tan fafani.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Yahudiyane mɔn yi kata Yesu suxu feen na, koni a yi a ba e yii.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Yesu mɔn yi xɛtɛ Yurudɛn kidi ma, Yoni yi marafuun tima dɛnaxan yi igeni a fɔlɔni. A sa lu na. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Muxu wuyaxi yi fa a fɛma, e naxa, “Yoni mi kabanako fe liga, koni a falan naxanye birin tixi xɛmɛni ito a fe yi, ɲɔndin nan ne ra.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Muxu wuyaxi yi dɛnkɛlɛya a ma mɛnni.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Lasarusi faxa fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Xɛmɛna nde yi furaxi, naxan yi xili Lasarusi Betani kaana, Mariyama nun a tada ɲaxalanmana, Marata yi dɔxi taan naxan yi. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Mariyama findi ɲaxanla nan na naxan latikɔnɔnna sa Marigin sanne ma, a yi e masugusugu a xun sɛxɛne ra, na ngaxakedenna Lasarusi nan yi furaxi. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Nanara, a tadane yi xɛraan nasiga Yesu ma, e naxa, “Marigina, i xɔyin bata fura.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Yesu to na mɛ, a naxa, “Saya fure mi a ra. Ito ligaxi nɛn alogo Ala xa binya. Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn binyama nɛn fureni ito xɔn ma.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Marata nun a xunyɛn ɲaxalanmaan nun Lasarusi yi rafan Yesu ma han! <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Anu, a to a mɛ fa fala a Lasarusi furaxi, a yi dɛnaxan yi, a mɔn yi xii firin ti mɛnni. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi a fala a xarandiine xa, a naxa, “En xɛtɛ Yudaya yamanani.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>A xarandiine yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, a munma bu singen Yahudiyane yi waxi i magɔlɔn feni, i mɔn waxi xɛtɛ feni mɛnna nin ba?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Yanyin birin na, kɛnɛnna mi na ba? Naxan na sigan ti yanyin na, na mi dagalanma ayi amasɔtɔ a dunuɲa kɛnɛnna toma. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Koni xa muxun sigan ti kɔɛɛn na, a dagalanma ayi nɛn amasɔtɔ kɛnɛnna mi na.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Yesu to na fala, a naxa, “En xɔyin Lasarusi xiin nɛn, koni n xa sa a raxulun.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>A xarandiine yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Marigina, xa a xiin nɛn, a kɛndɛyama nɛn.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Koni Yesu yi Lasarusi faxa feen nan ma fe falama nun. A xarandiine yi mirixi a ma, a xixɔnla nan tun yi a ma. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Nanara, Yesu yi falan makɛnɛn e xa, a naxa, “Lasarusi faxaxin nan a ra. <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>Koni n bata sɛwa ɛ tan ma fe ra bayo n mi yi a fɛma nun, alogo ɛ xa dɛnkɛlɛya. En siga a fɛma.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Nayi, Tomasi, naxan yi xili a “Gulunna,” na yi a fala xarandiin bonne xa, a naxa, “En fan xa siga, alogo en birin xa sa faxa!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nan nii rakisin fima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Yesu to fa, a yi a kolon a Lasarusi maluxunna bata yi xii naanin ti. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Betani nun Yerusalɛn taan yi tagi so, fɔ kilo saxan ɲɔxɔn. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Yahudiya wuyaxi bata yi fa nun Marata nun Mariyama xunyɛ xɛmɛmaan saya xɔntɔnna tideni e ma.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Marata to a mɛ, a Yesu fama, a yi siga a ralandeni koni Mariyama yi lu banxini. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Marata yi a fala Yesu xa, a naxa, “N Marigina, xa i yi be nun, n xunyɛn mi yi faxɛ nun! <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Koni n na a kolon, hali iki, i na Ala maxandi fefe ra, a na ligama i xa nɛn.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I xunyɛn mɔn kelima nɛn sayani.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Marata yi a yabi, a naxa, “N na a kolon a kelima nɛn sayani dunuɲa raɲanni.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N tan nan marakeli tiin na sayani e nun nii rakisin na. Naxan na dɛnkɛlɛya n tan ma, hali a faxa, a nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Naxan na lu a nii ra a dɛnkɛlɛya n ma, na mi faxɛ mumɛ! I laxi ito ra ba?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Marata yi a yabi, a naxa, “Ɔn Marigina, n laxi a ra fa fala Alaa Muxu Sugandixin nan i tan na, Alaa Dii Xɛmɛna, naxan yi fama dunuɲa yi nun.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Marata na fala xanbini, a xɛtɛ, a yi a xunyɛn Mariyama xili wundoni, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Karamɔxɔ be yi, a i xilima.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Mariyama na mɛ waxatin naxan yi, a yi keli mafurɛn, a sa a ralan. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Yesu munma yi taan li nun, Marata a li dɛnaxan yi, a yi mɛnna nin nun. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Yahudiyan naxanye siga Mariyama xɔntɔndeni, ne a to waxatin naxan yi Mariyama bata keli mafurɛn, a mini, e yi bira a fɔxɔ ra. E yengi yi a ma, a sigan gaburun dɛɛn nan na wugadeni.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Mariyama Yesu fɛman li waxatin naxan yi, a yi a to, a yi a xinbi sin a bun ma, a naxa, “Marigina, xa i yi be nun, n xunyɛn mi yi faxɛ nun!” <verse eid="JHN 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Yesu yi a to, a wugama, Yahudiyan naxanye fan yi a fɔxɔ ra, ne fan yi wugama, na yi a niin sunu han! <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>A yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ a maluxunxi minɛn yi?” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Marigina, fa a mato.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yesu yi wuga. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Na ma, Yahudiyane naxa, “A bata a xanu kii naxan yi, ɛ na mato!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Koni nde naxa, “Ito xa mi danxutɔɔn yɛɛn nabi ba? A mi yi a ligɛ nun, Lasarusi nama faxa ba?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lasarusi rakeli fena sayani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Yesu bɔɲɛn yi sunuxi, a siga gaburun dɛɛn na. Faranna nan yi a ra nun, gɛmɛn saxi a dɛɛn na. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Yesu yi e yamari, a naxa, “Ɛ gɛmɛn ba a dɛ ra!” Faxa muxun tadan ɲaxalanmaan Marata yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Marigina, a xirin nan fa minima iki amasɔtɔ a maluxunna bata soge naanin ti.” <verse eid="JHN 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N mi yi a fala i xa nun fa fala xa i dɛnkɛlɛyaxi, i Alaa binyen toma nɛn?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Nayi, e gɛmɛn ba na. Yesu yi a yɛɛ rate kore, a yi Ala maxandi, a naxa, “N Fafe, n barikan birama i xa amasɔtɔ i bata n xuiin mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>N na a kolon fa fala i n xuiin mɛma waxatin birin. Koni n ni ito falama muxuni itoe nan ma fe ra naxanye tixi be, alogo e xa la a ra fa fala a i tan nan n xɛxi.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>A to na fala, a yi a xuini te, a naxa, “Lasarusi, mini!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Faxa muxun yi keli gaburun kui, a sanna nun a yiine raxidixi kasangenna ra, a xunna fan mafilinxi kasangenni. Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ a mafulun, ɛ a lu, a xa siga.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">E wundo fena Yesu xili ma</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.1-5, Maraka 14.1-2, Luka 22.1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Nanara, Yahudiyan naxanye yi na Mariyama xɔntɔndeni, Yesu feen naxan liga, e to na to, e wuyaxi yi dɛnkɛlɛya a ma. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Koni nde yi siga Farisi muxune fɛma. Yesu feen naxan ligaxi, e sa na fala e xa.<verse eid="JHN 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Nanara, saraxarali kuntigine nun Farisi muxune yi kitisa yamaan xili bode toni, e naxa, “En nanfe ligama? Xɛmɛni ito kabanako fe wuyaxi ligama! <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Xa en na a lu iki, muxune birin dɛnkɛlɛyama a ma nɛn. Romi kuntigine kelima nɛn, e yi en ma yire sariɲanxin kala e nun en siyaan birin!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.48</char> Yesu a waxatini, Romi kaane Isirayila yamanan suxu nɛn yɛngɛni. Nayi, xa Yerusalɛn taani maxa ɲaxi ra, Romi kaane yi na yatɛma nɛn murutɛn na nun, e fa yɛngɛn so, e taan yirene kala. Na nan gaxu yi Isirayila kaane ma.</note> <verse eid="JHN 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>E tan nde keden nan yi xili Kayafa, naxan yi Saraxarali Kuntigi Singen na nun na ɲɛɛn na, a yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛ mi fefe kolon! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Ɛ mi a kolon ba, fa fala a fisa muxu kedenna xa faxa yamaan xa benun siyaan birin xa halagi?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Anu, a mi na falaxi a yɛtɛ ma. Kayafa to yi saraxarali kuntigiyani nun na ɲɛɛn na, a waliyiya falan nan tixi na ra fa fala Yesu xa faxa Yahudiyane siyaan xa. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>Koni na siyaan gbansanna xa mi a ra fɔ Ala diin naxanye xuyaxi ayi, a yi ne findi yama kedenna ra. <verse eid="JHN 11:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Nba, fɔlɔ na waxatin ma, Yahudiya kuntigine yi Yesu faxa feni tɔn. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Nanara, Yesu mi fa a masiga ti Yudaya yamanani kɛnɛnni sɔnɔn koni a keli, a siga taana nde yi tonbonna dɛxɔn ma, dɛnaxan xili Efirami. E nun a xarandiine yi lu na yi.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Yahudiyane sanla, Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.55</char> <char style="fk">Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla:</char> Musaa waxatini, Ala fitina feen nafa nɛn Firawona yamaan ma, malekan yi fa e dii singene birin faxa kɔɛ kedenna ra. Koni, Isirayila kaane yi saraxa wunla xuya e banxine dɛ wudine ma, saya malekan yi dangu e xun ma. Na feen sanla ni ito ra. A mato Xɔrɔyaan 12.1-13 kui.</note> bata yi maso. Muxu wuyaxi yi keli na yamanani siga Yerusalɛn taani alogo e xa sa e yɛtɛ rasariɲan benun sanla xa a li. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>E yi lu Yesu fenɲɛ. E yi malanxi Ala Batu Banxini waxatin naxan yi, e yi lu e bode maxɔdinɲɛ, e naxa, “Ɛ mirixi nanse ma? A mi fɛ sanli ba?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Saraxarali kuntigine nun Farisi muxune bata yi yamarin fi, e naxa, xa naxan Yesu yire kolon, a xa a yire ba alogo e xa sa a suxu.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Latikɔnɔnna sa fena Yesu ma</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.6-13, Maraka 14.3-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>A bata yi lu soge sennin benun Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla xa a li, Yesu yi siga Betani taani, Lasarusi yi dɔxi dɛnaxan yi, Yesu naxan nakeli sayani. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>E yi donseen nafala a xa na yi. Lasarusi yi dɔxi Yesu fɛma a dɛgedeni, Marata yi walima e xa. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Nba, Mariyama yi latikɔnɔnna sare xɔdɛxɛn litiri tagi tongo, naxan xili naradi, a yi a sa Yesu sanne ma. A yi e masugusugu a xunsɛxɛn na. Latikɔnɔnna xirin yi banxin suxu. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Yudasi Isakariyoti, Yesu a xarandiina nde naxan yi a yanfama, a a so yiini, na yi a fala, a naxa, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>“Nanfera latikɔnɔnni ito mi matixi gbeti gbanan kɛmɛ saxan na, a so yiigelitɔne yii?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>A mi na falaxi fa fala a xaminxi yiigelitɔne fe ra, koni bayo muɲaden nan yi a tan na nun. Gbeti bɛnbɛnla yi ramaraxi a tan nan yii. A yi na gbetina nde donma nun. <verse eid="JHN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Koni Yesu naxa, “Fata a ra! A ito maraxi n binbin maluxun lɔxɔn nan yɛɛ ra. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Yiigelitɔne ɛ fɛma waxatin birin koni n tan mi luma ɛ fɛma waxatin birin.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">E yi Lasarusi fan faxa feni tɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Yahudiya wuyaxi yi a mɛ, a Yesu na yi. E yi siga Yesu nun Lasarusi fan matodeni Yesu naxan nakeli sayani. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Na ma, saraxarali kuntigine yi Lasarusi fan faxa feni tɔn. <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>Amasɔtɔ Yahudiya wuyaxi yi xɛtɛma e fɔxɔ ra, e yi dɛnkɛlɛya Yesu ma Lasarusi a fe ra.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi so Yerusalɛn taani</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 21.1-11, Maraka 11.1-11, Luka 19.28-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Na xɔtɔn bode, yama gbeen naxan yi faxi sanli, ne yi a mɛ, a Yesu fama Yerusalɛn taani. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Nanara, e sa tugu yiine masɛgɛ, e sa a ralan, e sɔnxɔ, e naxa, “Ala tantun! Naxan fama Marigin xinli, Ala xa na baraka! Ala xa Isirayila Mangan baraka!” <verse eid="JHN 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Yesu yi sofanla to, a dɔxɔ a fari alo a sɛbɛxi Kitabuni kii naxan yi, a naxa,<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>“Siyon kaane, ɛ nama gaxu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">A mato, ɛ mangan fama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">A dɔxi sofali diin fari.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.15</char> Sakari 9.9</note><verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>A xarandiine mi yi na birin famuxi singen, koni Yesu binya waxatin naxan yi, nayi e yi a kolon a na feene yi sɛbɛxi a tan nan ma fe ra, a e tan yɛtɛɛn bata yi na liga a xa.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Yamaan naxan yi Yesu fɛma a Lasarusi xili gaburun na waxatin naxan yi, a yi a rakeli sayani, ne birin yi lu na seren bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Nanara, yamaan yi siga a ralandeni amasɔtɔ e bata a mɛ Yesu kabanako feen naxan ligaxi. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Farisi muxune yi a fala e bode xa, e naxa, “Ɛ mi a to, en katan naxan tima, a munanfan yo mi en ma! A mato, dunuɲa muxune birin biraxi a fɔxɔ ra!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Girɛkina ndee yi Yesu fen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Girɛkina ndee bata yi siga sanli Ala batudeni. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>E fa Filipi fɛma naxan yi kelixi Betasada taani Galile yamanani, e yi maxɔdinna ti, e naxa, “Nxu Fafe, nxu waxi a xɔn ma, nxu xa Yesu to.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filipi yi sa a fala Andire xa, e firinna birin yi siga, e sa a fala Yesu xa.<verse eid="JHN 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn binya waxatin bata a li. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, fanni sansi kɛsɛn mi bira bɔxɔni a yɛɛ maluxun, a mi wuyɛ ayi. Koni xa a yɛɛ maluxun, a solima nɛn, a wuya ayi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Muxu yo niin nafan a ma, a bɔnɔma a yi nɛn, koni muxu yo a mɛ a niin na dunuɲa ito yi, na a ramarama nɛn habadan nii rakisini. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Muxu yo waxi a xɔn ma, a xa wanla kɛ n xa fɔ a xa bira n fɔxɔ ra nɛn. Nayi, n dɛnaxan yi, n ma walikɛɛn fan luma nɛn mɛnni. Muxu yo wanla kɛma n xa, n Fafe Ala na binyama nɛn.”<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi a faxa feen fala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>Yesu naxa, “N bɔɲɛn tɔrɔxi na a ra iki. N nanfe falama? N xa a fala ba, fa fala, ‘N Fafe, i nama tin waxatini ito xa n li?’ Anu, n faxi na nan ma. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>N Fafe, i xinla binya!” Nayi, fala xuiin yi keli kore naxan a fala, a naxa, “N bata a binya, n mɔn a binyama nɛn.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Yamaan naxan yi tixi na, ne yi fala xuiin mɛ, e naxa, “Galanna bata a xui ramini!” Ndee naxa, “Malekan bata falan ti a xa!” <verse eid="JHN 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Fala xuini ito mi minixi n tan ma fe ra, fɔ ɛ tan ma fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Dunuɲa kitin bolon waxatin bata a li iki. Ala dunuɲani ito kuntigi ɲaxin kedima nɛn iki. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>N na yite<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.32</char> Yesu <char style="fk">yite</char> nɛn a yelin xanbini gbangbanɲɛ wudin ma. A mɔn yi <char style="fk">te</char> ariyanna yi. Yesu falan tima na fe firinna nan ma. A mato Yoni 3.14 kui.</note> bɔxɔn ma waxatin naxan yi, n muxune birin mabandunma nɛn n ma.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>A ito falaxi nɛn alogo a xa a faxa kiin yita e ra. <verse eid="JHN 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Yamaan yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nxu bata a kolon Sariya Kitabun xɔn, a Alaa Muxu Sugandixin luma nɛn habadan. I tan a falama nanfera fa fala a Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛni tema nɛn? Nde Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛni ito ra?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Kɛnɛnna kanna mɔn ɛ yɛ singen waxatidi tun. Kɛnɛnna ɛ tagi waxatin naxan yi ɛ sigan ti, alogo dimin nama so ɛ ma. Bayo naxan dimini, na mi a sigaden kolon. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Kɛnɛnna kanna ɛ tagi waxatin naxan yi, ɛ dɛnkɛlɛya a ma, alogo ɛ xa findi kɛnɛnna muxune ra.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu ito fala e xa waxatin naxan yi, a yi siga, a a luxun e ma.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yahudiyane mi tin dɛnkɛlɛyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Hali a to kabanako fe wuyaxi liga e yɛɛ xɔri, e mi la a ra. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Na liga nɛn alogo Nabi Esayi fala xuiin xa kamali, a naxa, “Marigina, nde laxi nxɔ falan na? Marigina a sɛnbɛn makɛnɛn nde xa?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.38</char> Esayi 53.1</note><verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Nanara, e mi yi nɔɛ dɛnkɛlɛyɛ bayo Esayi mɔn naxa,<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>“A bata e yɛɛn danxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">a yi e bɔɲɛn xɔdɔxɔ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">alogo e yɛɛne nama toon ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">e xaxinla nama feene famu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">a e nama maxɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Ala yi e rakɛndɛya.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.40</char> Esayi 6.9-10</note><verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Esayi na falaxi nɛn, bayo a bata yi Yesu a binyen to, a yi a tan nan ma fe falama.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Anu, hali yamaan kuntigine yɛ, muxu wuyaxi dɛnkɛlɛya nɛn Yesu ma. Koni e mi yi tinma a falɛ Farisi muxune fe ra alogo e nama e ramini salideni. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>A rafan e ma muxune xa e binya benun Ala xa e binya.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kitisana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Yesu yi a xuini te, a naxa, “Naxan na dɛnkɛlɛya n ma, a mi dɛnkɛlɛyaxi n tan xan tun ma fɔ naxan n xɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Muxu yo n to, na bata n xɛ muxun fan to. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>N bata fa dunuɲa yi alo kɛnɛnna kanna. Naxan na dɛnkɛlɛya n ma, na mi luyɛ dimini. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Muxu yo n ma falan mɛ, a mi a suxu, n tan xa mi a yalagima. Amasɔtɔ n mi faxi dunuɲa muxune yalagideni, fɔ e rakisideni. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Naxan na a mɛ n na, a mi tin n ma falane suxɛ. N ma falan na kanna yalagima nɛn lɔxɔ dɔnxɛni. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Amasɔtɔ n mi falan tima n yɛtɛ xan ma fe ra fɔ n Fafe Ala naxan n xɛxi. Na nan n ma fala tixine yamarima n ma. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>N na a kolon fa fala a yamarin findima nɛn habadan nii rakisin na. N falan tiin nɛn alo n Fafe Ala a yamarixi n ma kii naxan yi.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi a xarandiine sanne maxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Nba, na xɔtɔn bode, Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla nan yi a ra. Yesu yi a kolon fa fala a keli waxatin bata a li dunuɲa yi, siga a Fafe Ala konni. A gbee muxun naxanye yi dunuɲa yi, a yi ne xanu waxatin birin, a yi e xanu han a raɲanna.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>E yi e dɛgema waxatin naxan yi, Yinna Manga Setana bata yi yelin soɛ Simɔn ma dii xɛmɛn Yudasi Isakariyoti bɔɲɛni a xa Yesu yanfa, a a so yiini. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Yesu yi a kolon fa fala Fafe Ala bata feen birin sa a sɛnbɛni. A yi a kolon fa fala a fataxi Ala nan na, a mɔn sigama Ala nan ma. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Nanara, e to yi e dɛgema, a yi keli, a yi a doma gbeen ba a ma, a dugin xidi a tagi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi igen sa ige sa seen kui, a yi fɔlɔ a xarandiine sanne maxɛ. Dugin naxan yi xidixi a tagi, a yi e sanne masugusugu na ra. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>A yi fa Simɔn Piyɛri fɛma, na yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Marigina, i tan nan n sanna maxama ba?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “I mi a kolon n naxan ligama iki, koni i fama a kolondeni nɛn.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Piyɛri yi a fala, a naxa, “I tan mi n sanna maxɛ mumɛ!” Yesu yi a yabi a naxa, “Xa n mi i sanna maxa, i mi findɛ n ma xarandiin na.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simɔn Piyɛri yi a yabi, a naxa, “Marigina, i nama n sanna gbansanna maxa nayi, koni e nun n yiine nun n xunna!” <verse eid="JHN 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “Naxan bata a gbindin maxa, na mako mi fa a maxan ma fɔ a sanne, bayo a sariɲan. Ɛ fan sariɲan, koni ɛ birin mi a ra.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Yesu yi a yanfa muxun kolon. Nanara, a yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛ birin mi sariɲan.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Yesu yelin e sanne maxɛ waxatin naxan yi, a yi a doma gbeen nagodo a ma, a mɔn yi sa dɔxɔ a funfuni. A yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “N naxan ligaxi ito ra, ɛ na famunxi ba? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Ɛ n tan xilima fa fala ‘Karamɔxɔ’ e nun ‘Marigina.’ Na falan lanxi amasɔtɔ na nan n tan na. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Xa n tan ɛ Marigin nun ɛ karamɔxɔn bata ɛ sanne maxa, ɛ tan fan xa ɛ bode sanne maxa. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>N misaala yitaxi ɛ ra nɛn, alogo ɛ xa a liga alo n na a ligaxi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, konyin mi gbo a kanna xa, xɛraan mi gbo a xɛ muxun xa. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Ɛ bata feni itoe kolon iki, sɛwana ɛ xa, xa ɛ lu na ligɛ!”<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>“N mi falan tima ɛ birin ma fe ra. N bata naxanye sugandi, n ne kolon. Koni fɔ Kitabun fala xuiin xa rakamali nɛn, a naxa, ‘Nxu nun naxan donseen donma nxu bode xɔn, na bata keli n xili ma.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.18</char> Yaburin 41.10</note> <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>N ni ito falama ɛ xa iki benun a xa liga. Nayi, a na liga waxatin naxan yi, ɛ lama a ra nɛn, fa fala, ‘N tan nan a ra, naxan na yi.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.19 </char> A sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 3.14 kui fa fala Ala xinla yɛtɛɛn findixi na falan nan na bayo Ala naxa mɛnni, “N tan na a ra, Ala naxan na yi.” Ala mɔn naxa mɛnni fa fala a yɛtɛɛn xili nɛn “N Na Yi.” Nayi, Yesu a falani ito bunna nɛn fa fala Yesu findixi Alaa falan nan na, falan naxan findixi Ala ra. Na feen mɔn sɛbɛxi Yoni 1.1 kui.</note><verse eid="JHN 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>“N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa. Naxan na n ma xɛrani suxu, na bata n fan yisuxu. Naxan na n tan yisuxu, na kanna bata Ala yisuxu naxan n xɛxi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasi Yesu yanfama nɛn</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.20-25, Maraka 14.17-21, Luka 22.21-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Yesu ito fala waxatin naxan yi, a niin yi sunu! A yi sereya falani ito ti, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, ɛ tan nde keden n yanfama nɛn, a n so yiini yati!” <verse eid="JHN 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>A xarandiine yi e bode mato, e mi yi a kolon a yi muxun naxan ma. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Yesu a xarandii keden yi na, a yi naxan xanuxi kati, na yi dɔxi a dɛxɔn ma. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Simɔn Piyɛri yi a yiin maliga na xa, a naxa, “A maxɔdin, a nde a fe falama.” <verse eid="JHN 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Na xarandiin yi a maso Yesu ra, a yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “N Marigina, nde na ra?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “N na donseen sin sabini, n na a so naxan yii, na kanna nan a ra.” Awa, a donseen sin sabini, a yi a so Simɔn ma dii xɛmɛn Yudasi Isakariyoti yii. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Yudasi donseen nasuxina, Setana yi so a yi sa! Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I naxan ligama, na liga mafurɛn.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Yesu naxan fala a xa, bonna naxanye yi dɔxi e dɛgedeni, ne sese mi yi na famunxi. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Bayo Yudasi nan yi e gbetin marama, ndee yengi yi lu a ma, a Yesu bata a fala a xa, a xa sa sena ndee sara sanla fe ra. Hanma a xa sa sena nde so yiigelitɔne yii. <verse eid="JHN 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Yudasi yi na donseen nasuxu, a mini na sa! Kɔɛɛn nan yi a ra.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sariya nɛnɛna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Yudasi siga waxatin naxan yi, Yesu naxa, “Iki, n tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛna binyen bata makɛnɛn, Alaa binyen fan bata makɛnɛn n barakani. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Xa Alaa binyen bata makɛnɛn n tan barakani, Ala yɛtɛna n tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛna binyen makɛnɛnma nɛn mafurɛn!”<verse eid="JHN 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>“N ma diine, n mi buma ɛ fɛma sɔnɔn. Ɛ n fenma nɛn, koni n naxan fala Yahudiyane xa, n na nan falama ɛ fan xa, n naxa, ‘N sigama yiren naxan yi, ɛ mi nɔɛ sigɛ na yi.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>N yamari nɛnɛn nan soma ɛ yi, ɛ bode xanu. Ɛ ɛ bode xanu alo n na ɛ xanuxi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Ɛ na ɛ bode xanu, muxune birin ɛ kolonma n ma xarandiine ra na nan xɔn.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi Piyɛri rakolon</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.31-35, Maraka 14.27-31, Luka 22.31-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simɔn Piyɛri yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Marigina, i sigan minɛn yi?” Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “N sigama dɛnaxan yi, i mi nɔɛ sigɛ n fɔxɔ ra mɛnni iki, koni i sigama n fɔxɔ ra nɛn waxati famatɔni.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Piyɛri yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Marigina, nanfera, n mi nɔɛ birɛ i fɔxɔ ra iki? N faxɛ nɛn i ya fe ra!” <verse eid="JHN 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “I faxɛ n ma fe ra ba? N xa ɲɔndin fala i xa, benun dontonne xa wuga waxatin naxan yi, i ya falama nɛn dɔxɔɲa ma saxan fa fala i mi n kolon.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Kiraan nan Yesu ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ bɔɲɛn nama tɔrɔ, ɛ dɛnkɛlɛya Ala ma, ɛ dɛnkɛlɛya n tan fan ma. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Banxi wuyaxi n Fafe Ala konni. Xa a mi yi na kiini, n yi a falama ɛ xa nɛn nun. N sigama n xa sa yirena nde yitɔn ɛ xa na yi. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>N na sa yirena nde yitɔn ɛ xa, n mɔn fama nɛn, n yi siga ɛ ra n yii alogo n dɛnaxan yi, ɛ fan yi sa lu mɛnni. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>N sigan dɛnaxan yi, ɛ mɛn kiraan kolon.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Tomasi yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Marigina, nxu mi i sigaden kolon, nxu na kiraan kolonma di?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “Kiraan nan n tan na, e nun ɲɔndina e nun nii rakisina. Muxu yo mi sigɛ n Fafe Ala ma n tan ma sabuyaan xanbi. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Xa ɛ n tan kolon, ɛ n Fafe fan kolonma nɛn. To xanbi ra, ɛ bata a kolon, ɛ bata a to.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filipi yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Marigina, Fafe Ala yita nxu ra, na nan nxu wasama.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “Filipi, en bata bu en bode fɛma kati! Han to, i mi n kolon? Muxu yo na n to, na kanna bata Fafe Ala to. I tan a falama nanfera fa fala a n xa Fafe Ala yita ɛ ra? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Filipi, i mi laxi a ra ba, fa fala n Fafe Ala yi, Fafe Ala n fan yi? N falan naxanye tima ɛ xa, n gbee mi ne ra. Koni n Fafe Ala naxan luma n tan yi, na nan a wanla kɛma. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Ɛ dɛnkɛlɛya a ma fa fala n Fafe Ala yi, Fafe Ala n fan yi. Hanma ɛ dɛnkɛlɛya kabanako fe wanli itoe xɔn.”<verse eid="JHN 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>“N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, naxan na dɛnkɛlɛya n ma, na feene ligama nɛn alo n naxanye ligama. A yɛtɛɛn feene ligama nɛn naxanye gbo itoe xa, amasɔtɔ n sigama n Fafe Ala fɛma. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Ɛ na Ala maxandi fefe ra n tan xinli, n na ligama ɛ xa nɛn alogo n Fafe Alaa binyen xa mayita a Dii Xɛmɛn barakani. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Xa ɛ n xandi fefe ra n xinli, n na ligama ɛ xa nɛn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14.14</char> <char style="fk">Ala maxandi</char> feni ito mɔn sɛbɛxi Yoni 15.16 nun 16.23-26 nun 15.7 kui.</note>”<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin fa fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>“Xa ɛ n xanuxi, ɛ n ma yamarine suxu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>N Fafe Ala maxandima nɛn, a yi Mali Ti gbɛtɛ so ɛ yii naxan luma ɛ fɛma habadan. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nan a ra, ɲɔndin kanna. Dunuɲa muxune mi nɔɛ na sɔtɛ amasɔtɔ e mi nɔɛ a toɛ, e mi a kolonɲɛ. Koni ɛ tan a kolon amasɔtɔ a luma nɛn ɛ fɛma, a mɔn yi lu ɛ yi. <verse eid="JHN 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>N mi ɛ luyɛ alo kiridine, n mɔn fama nɛn ɛ fɛma. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Ndedi nan fa luxi, dunuɲa muxune mi fa n toma sɔnɔn koni ɛ tan n toma nɛn. Bayo n tan bata niin kisin sɔtɔ, ɛ fan nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Na waxatin na a li, ɛ a kolonma nɛn, a n Fafe Ala yi, ɛ tan fan n tan yi alo n tan ɛ yi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="JHN 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>Muxu yo n ma yamarine sɔtɔ, a yi e suxu, na nan bata n xanu. Muxu yo n xanu, n Fafe Ala fan na kanna xanuma nɛn, n tan fan yi a xanu, n yi n yɛtɛ yita a ra.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Yudasi bonna, Yudasi Isakariyoti mi naxan na, na yi a fala, a naxa, “Marigina, nanfera i lan i xa i yɛtɛ yita nxu ra, koni i mi i yɛtɛ yitɛ dunuɲa muxune ra?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “Muxu yo n xanu, na n ma falan suxuma nɛn. N Fafe Ala fan yi a xanu, n tan nun n Fafe Ala yi siga a fɛma, nxu yi nxu konni tɔn a fɛma. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Muxu yo mi n xanu, na mi n ma falan suxɛ. Ɛ bata falan naxan mɛ, n gbee fala mi na ra. N Fafe Ala naxan n xɛxi, na nan gbee na ra.”<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>“N to yi ɛ fɛma, nanara, n falani itoe ti ɛ xa. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Koni Mali Tiina, Alaa Nii Sariɲanxina, Fafe Ala naxan nafama ɛ ma n xinli, na ɛ xaranma nɛn feen birin ma. N feen naxan birin falaxi ɛ xa, a ne birin nabirama nɛn ɛ ma.”<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>“N bata bɔɲɛ xunbenla lu ɛ yi. N bata n ma bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi ɛ ma. N mi a fixi ɛ ma alo dunuɲa kiin tima kii naxan yi. Ɛ bɔɲɛn nama tɔrɔ, ɛ nama gaxu. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Ɛ bata n ma falan mɛ, n naxa, ‘N sigama koni n mɔn fama ɛ fɛma nɛn.’ Xa ɛ yi n xanuxi, ɛ yi sɛwama nɛn n siga feen na n Fafe Ala konni amasɔtɔ a gbo n tan xa. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>N feni itoe falama ɛ xa nɛn iki benun a xa liga. Nanara, a na liga waxatin naxan yi, ɛ dɛnkɛlɛyama nɛn. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>N mi fa buma falan tiyɛ ɛ fɛma sɔnɔn, amasɔtɔ dunuɲa ito kuntigi ɲaxin fama. Sese mi a ra n tan yi. <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>Koni dunuɲa xa a kolon fa fala n bata n Fafe Ala xanu. Nanara, n feen birin ligama alo a n yamarixi kii naxan yi. Ɛ keli, ɛ fa, en siga.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Ɲɔndin binla nan Yesu ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>Yesu yi a fala, a naxa, “N tan nan ɲɔndin binla ra alo wudin binla. N Fafe Ala nan nakɔɔn kanna ra. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Wudi yiin naxanye birin n tan wudi binla ma, xa na naxanye mi bogi, Fafe Ala ne bama nɛn n ma. Naxanye birin bogima, a ne rasariɲanma nɛn alogo e mɔn xa bogi dangu a singen na. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>N falan naxan tixi ɛ xa, na bata ɛ sariɲan iki. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Ɛ lu n tan yi, n fan yi lu ɛ yi. Wudi yiin mi nɔɛ bogɛ a yɛtɛ ra, xa a mi a binla ma. Ɛ fan na kii nin, xa ɛ mi lu n tan yi. <verse eid="JHN 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>N tan nan wudin binla ra, a yiine nan ɛ tan na. Naxan na lu n tan yi, n tan fan luma nɛn na kanni, a yi bogi wuyaxi ti a kɛwanli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.5</char> Wudi faɲin bogi faɲin nan tima. Adamadi faɲin fan <char style="fk">kɛwali</char> faɲin nan ligama. Na luxi nɛn alo wudin nun a bogina. Na feen mɔn sɛbɛxi Galati 5.22 kui.</note> Amasɔtɔ ɛ mi nɔɛ sese ligɛ n tan xanbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Xa muxun naxan mi lu n tan yi, na rawolima ayi nɛn alo wudi yiina, a xara. Na wudi yii sifane malanma nɛn, e sa tɛɛni, e gan. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Xa ɛ lu n tan yi, n ma falan yi lu ɛ yi, ɛ na n xandi sese yi, ɛ na sɔtɔma nɛn. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Ɛ na findi n ma xarandiine ra, ɛ yi bogi wuyaxi ti ɛ kɛwanli, na nan n Fafe Alaa binyen makɛnɛnma.”<verse eid="JHN 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>“N Fafe Ala n xanuxi kii naxan yi, n fan bata ɛ xanu na kiini. Ɛ lu n ma xanuntenyani. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Xa ɛ n ma yamarine suxu, ɛ luma nɛn n ma xanuntenyani alo n fan n Fafe Alaa yamarin suxi kii naxan yi, n lu a xanuntenyani. <verse eid="JHN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>N ni ito falaxi ɛ xa nɛn alogo n ma sɛwan xa lu ɛ yi, ɛ sɛwan yi dɛfe.”<verse eid="JHN 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>“N ma yamarin nan ito ra, ɛ bode xanu alo n na ɛ xanuxi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Xanuntenyaan mi muxu yo yi dangu ito ra fa fala a xa faxa a xɔyine fe ra. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Xa ɛ n ma yamarine suxu, n xɔyine nan ɛ tan na. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>N mi fa a falama ɛ ma sɔnɔn fa fala walikɛne amasɔtɔ walikɛɛn mi a kolon a kuntigin naxan ligama. Koni n fa ɛ xili bama nɛn, ‘n xɔyine’ amasɔtɔ n naxan birin mɛxi n Fafe Ala ra, n bata na yɛba ɛ xa. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Ɛ tan mi n sugandixi koni n tan bata ɛ sugandi, n yi ɛ ti a ra a ɛ xa siga, ɛ sa bogi wuyaxi ti ɛ kɛwanle xɔn, bogin naxanye luma a ra habadan alogo ɛ na fefe maxandi n xinli, n Fafe Ala xa na fi ɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>N ma yamarin nan ito ra, ɛ bode xanu.”<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dunuɲa muxune ɛ raɲaxuma nɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>“Xa dunuɲa muxune ɛ raɲaxu, ɛ xaxili lu a xɔn ma fa fala a e n singe nan naɲaxu. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Xa dunuɲa muxun nan yi ɛ tan na nun, dunuɲa muxune yi ɛ xanuma nɛn alo e kon kaane. Koni n bata ɛ sugandi keli dunuɲa muxune tagi. E gbee mi fa ɛ tan na. Na nan a ligaxi dunuɲa muxune ɛ raɲaxuxi. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>N naxan falaxi ɛ xa, ɛ xaxili lu na xɔn ma, n naxa, ‘Konyin mi gbo a kanna xa.’ Xa e bata n tan bɛsɛnxɔnya, e ɛ fan bɛsɛnxɔnyama nɛn. Xa e bata n ma falan suxu, e ɛ fan gbeen suxuma nɛn. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Koni e ito birin ligama ɛ ra nɛn amasɔtɔ n gbeen nan ɛ tan na, bayo e mi n xɛ muxun kolon. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Xa n mi yi fa nun, n fa falan ti e xa, e mi yi yatɛma yulubi tongone ra nun. Koni iki, mawuga yo mi fa e xa yulubina fe ra sɔnɔn. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Muxu yo n tan naɲaxu, na kanna bata n Fafe Ala fan naɲaxu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Xa n mi yi kabanako fe wanle kɛ e tagi nun, muxu gbɛtɛ munma yi naxanye liga singen, e mi yi yatɛn yulubi tongone ra nun. Koni iki, n naxan ligaxi, e bata na to. Hali na, e n tan nun n Fafe Ala raɲaxuxi. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Koni naxan sɛbɛxi e Sariya Kitabun kui, fɔ na xa kamali nɛn, a naxa, ‘E bata n tan naɲaxu fuuni.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.25</char> Yaburin 35.19 nun 69.5</note> ”<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>“Mali Tiin na fa, n naxan nafama sa keli Fafe Ala fɛma, Alaa Nii Sariɲanxina, ɲɔndin kanna, na n ma fe sereyaan bama nɛn. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Ɛ tan fan n ma fe sereyaan bama nɛn amasɔtɔ ɛ yi n fɔxɔ ra nun xabu a fɔlɔni.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>“N ni ito birin falaxi ɛ xa nɛn alogo ɛ nama bira tantanni. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>E ɛ kedima nɛn salide banxine yi. Nba, waxatina nde fama, xa muxu yo ɛ faxa, na kanna a mirima nɛn fa fala a bata Alaa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>E feni itoe ligama ɛ ra nɛn amasɔtɔ e mi n tan kolon, e mi n Fafe Ala fan kolon. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Koni n bata feni itoe fala ɛ xa. Nanara, e nɛma feni itoe ligɛ ɛ ra waxatin naxan yi, n ma falane rabirama ɛ ma nɛn. N munma yi feni itoe fala ɛ xa nun a singeni amasɔtɔ n yi ɛ fɛma.”<verse eid="JHN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin wanla fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>“Koni iki, n sigama n xɛ muxun fɛma koni ɛ tan sese mi n maxɔdinma fa fala, ‘I sigan minɛn yi?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Koni xabu n na a fala ɛ xa, ɛ bɔɲɛn bata rafɔrɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Hali na, n xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, a fisa ɛ ma n siga. Amasɔtɔ xa n mi siga, Mali Tiin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">16.7</char> <char style="fk">Mali Tiini</char> ito findixi Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nan na. A mi nɔɛ findɛ adamadi yo ra bayo a luma nɛn dɛnkɛlɛya muxune bɔɲɛni. Na feen sɛbɛxi Yoni 14.17 kui.</note> mi fama ɛ fɛma. Koni xa n siga, n Mali Tiin nafama ɛ ma nɛn. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>A na fa, a dunuɲa muxune tantanna yitama e ra nɛn lan yulubin nun tinxinyaan nun Ala kiti bolonna ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Yulubina, amasɔtɔ e mi dɛnkɛlɛyaxi n tan ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>Tinxinyana, amasɔtɔ n sigama n Fafe Ala konni, ɛ mi fa n toma sɔnɔn. <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>Kiti bolonna, amasɔtɔ dunuɲa kuntigi ɲaxin bata yelin yalagɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>“Fe wuyaxi n kui, n naxanye falɛ ɛ xa, koni e mi xanɲɛ ɛ ma iki. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Koni Alaa Nii Sariɲanxina, ɲɔndin kanna na fa, a ɛ tima nɛn ɲɔndin birin kiraan xɔn. A mi a yɛtɛ sagoon xan falama. Koni a naxan mɛma, a na nan falama ɛ xa. A yi fe famatɔne rali ɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>A n tan binyama nɛn amasɔtɔ a na naxan sɔtɔ n tan yii, a na nan nalima ɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>N gbeen nan n Fafe Ala yii seene birin na. Nanara, n naxa, ‘Alaa Niin na naxan sɔtɔ n yii, a na nan nalima ɛ ma.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɔɲɛ rafɔrɔn yi masara sɛwan na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>Awa, Yesu yi a fala, a naxa, “Ndedi mɔn luxi, ɛ mi fa n toma, koni na waxatidin na dangu ɛ mɔn n toma nɛn.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>A xarandiina ndee yi a fala e bode tagi, e naxa, “Ito bunna di? Fa fala, ‘Ndedi mɔn luxi, ɛ mi fa n toma, koni na waxatidin na dangu, ɛ mɔn n toma nɛn?’ A mɔn naxa, a sigama a Fafe fɛma.” <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>E yi a falama, e naxa, “A nanse falama ito ra, a naxa, ‘Waxatidi?’ En mi a kolon a naxan falama.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Yesu to a kolon fa fala e yi waxi a maxɔdin feni, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N naxan falaxi ɛ xa fa fala, ‘Ndedi mɔn luxi, ɛ mi fa n toma, koni na waxatidin na dangu, ɛ mɔn n toma nɛn’ ɛ ɛ bode maxɔdinma na nan ma ba? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, ɛ wugama nɛn, ɛ sunu koni dunuɲa muxune sɛwama nɛn. Ɛ bɔɲɛn nafɔrɔma nɛn koni ɛ bɔɲɛ rafɔrɔn findima nɛn sɛwan na. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Xa ɲaxanla diin barima waxatin naxan yi, a niini suxuma a ma nɛn kati, amasɔtɔ a waxatin nan na ra. Koni a na diin sɔtɔ waxatin naxan yi, a ɲinanma nɛn a tɔrɔn birin na, a sɛwa amasɔtɔ a bata diin sɔtɔ dunuɲa yi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Ɛ tan fan na kii nin. Ɛ bɔɲɛn nafɔrɔxi iki koni n mɔn ɛ toma nɛn. Ɛ bɔɲɛn yi rafe sɛwan na. Muxu yo mi nɔɛ ɛ sɛwan bɛ ɛ yii. <verse eid="JHN 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>Na waxatin na a li, ɛ mi n maxɔdinɲɛ fefe ra. N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, ɛ na n Fafe Ala maxandi fefe ra n tan xinli, a na fima ɛ ma nɛn. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Han iki, ɛ munma Ala maxandi fefe ra n xinli singen. Ɛ xandin ti, ɛ a sɔtɔma nɛn alogo ɛ sɛwan xa dɛfe.”<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bata dunuɲa nɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>“N bata yi feni itoe fala ɛ xa sandani. Koni waxatina nde fama, n mi fa falan tima ɛ xa na kiini, koni n nan n Fafe a fe makɛnɛnma ɛ xa nɛn na waxatini. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Na waxatin na a li, ɛ Ala maxandima nɛn n xinli. N mi a falama a n tan nan n Fafe maxɔdinma ɛ xa. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Na mi a ra. Amasɔtɔ Fafe Ala bata ɛ xanu bayo ɛ bata n tan xanu, ɛ bata la a ra fa fala n kelixi Ala nan ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>N kelixi n Fafe Ala nan fɛma, n fa dunuɲa ito yi. Iki n kelima dunuɲa yi, n siga n Fafe Ala fɛma.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>A xarandiine yi a fala, e naxa, “A mato, i falan tima nxu xa kɛnɛnna nin iki, i mi fa sanda sama sɔnɔn. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Nxu bata a kolon iki fa fala i feen birin kolon. Nanara, i mako mi a ma a muxe xa maxɔdinna ti. Nayi, nxu bata la a ra fa fala i kelixi Ala nan fɛma.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ bata la a ra iki ba? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Waxatina a limaan ni i ra, a bata a li, ɛ birin xuyama ayi nɛn na waxatini, ɛ birin yi siga ɛ konne yi. Ɛ yi n keden peen lu. Koni n keden mi a ra amasɔtɔ n Fafe Ala n fɛma. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>N feni itoe falaxi ɛ xa nɛn alogo ɛ xa bɔɲɛ xunbenla sɔtɔ n tan barakani. Ɛ tɔrɔma nɛn dunuɲani ito yi, koni ɛ wɛkilɛ! N tan bata dunuɲa nɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Yesu yelin na falɛ waxatin naxan yi, a yi a yɛɛ rate kore, a naxa, “N Fafe, waxatin bata a li. I ya Dii Xɛmɛna binyen makɛnɛn alogo i ya Dii Xɛmɛn xa i binya. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>I bata sɛnbɛn fi n tan ma adamadiine birin xun na, a n xa habadan nii rakisin fi muxune ma i naxanye soxi n yii. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Habadan nii rakisin nan ito ra, a e xa i tan Ala keden peen nan kolon e nun Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixina i naxan xɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>N bata i ya binyen makɛnɛn dunuɲa yi. I wanla naxan soxi n yii, n bata yelin na ra. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>N Fafe, iki n ma binyen makɛnɛn i yɛtagi, binyen naxan yi n yii i fɛma nun benun dunuɲa xa da.”<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>“I muxun naxanye fixi n ma dunuɲa yi, n bata i makɛnɛn ne xa. I gbeen nan yi e tan na. I bata e so n tan yii, e yi i ya falan suxu. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>E bata a kolon iki fa fala i seen naxan birin fixi n ma, ne kelixi i tan nan yii. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>I falan naxan tixi n xa, n bata na fala e xa, e yi a suxu. E bata a kolon yati, fa fala n kelixi i tan nin. E bata la a ra fa fala i tan nan n xɛxi.”<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>“N ni i tan Ala maxandima e xa. N mi i maxandima dunuɲa muxune birin xan xa fɔ i muxun naxanye soxi n yii amasɔtɔ i gbeen nan ne ra. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Naxanye birin n yii, i gbeen nan ne ra. I gbeen naxanye birin na, n gbeen nan ne ra. N binyaxi e tan xɔn. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Iki n sigama i fɛma, n mi fa luma dunuɲa yi sɔnɔn koni e tan mɔn dunuɲa yi. N Fafe sariɲanxina, i xinla naxan fixi n ma, e ratanga na xinla sɛnbɛni alogo e xa findi kedenna ra, alo en tan findixi kedenna ra kii naxan yi. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>N yi e fɛma waxatin naxan yi, i xinla naxan so n yii, n na e ratanga na xinla sɛnbɛn nan xɔn, n yi e kantan. Hali keden mi lɔ ayi, fɔ halagin yi ragidixi naxan ma, alogo Kitabun sɛbɛnla xa kamali. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Iki n sigama i fɛma, n bata feni itoe fala dunuɲa muxune xa alogo e xa n ma sɛwa dɛfexin sɔtɔ e bɔɲɛni. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>N bata i ya falan nali e ma koni dunuɲa muxune bata e raɲaxu amasɔtɔ dunuɲa gbee mi e tan na alo dunuɲa gbee to mi n tan na. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>N mi i mafanma fa fala i xa e ba dunuɲa yi koni n ni i mafanma nɛn, i xa e ratanga Fe Ɲaxin Kanna ma. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Dunuɲa gbee mi e ra alo dunuɲa gbee to mi n tan na. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>E rasariɲan ɲɔndin xɔn. I ya falan nan ɲɔndin na. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>I n xɛxi dunuɲa yi kii naxan yi, n fan bata e xɛ dunuɲa yi na kiini. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>N bata n yɛtɛ rasariɲan e fe ra alogo e fan xa rasariɲan ɲɔndin xɔn.”<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>“N mi i maxandima e tan xan tun ma fe ra, koni fɔ e nun muxun naxanye fan dɛnkɛlɛyama n ma e fala xuiin xɔn ma <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>alogo e birin xa findi muxu kedenna ra, alo i tan n tan yi kii naxan yi, e nun n fan i tan yi kii naxan yi. N Fafe, e fan xa findi kedenna ra en tan yi alogo dunuɲa muxune xa la a ra fa fala i tan nan n xɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>I binyen naxan soxi n yii, n fan bata na so e yii, alogo e fan xa findi kedenna ra alo n tan nun i tan kedenna ra kii naxan yi, <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>n tan e tan yi, i tan fan n tan yi. E xa findi kedenna ra ngaxakedenya kamalixini alogo dunuɲa muxune xa a kolon fa fala i tan nan n xɛxi, a i bata e xanu alo i n xanuxi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="JHN 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>N Fafe, i bata e so n yii. N dɛnaxan yi, n waxi a xɔn ma, e fan xa siga n fɔxɔ ra mɛnna nin, alogo e xa n ma binyen to, i binyen naxan fixi n ma, bayo i n xanuxi nɛn benun dunuɲa xa da. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>N Fafe tinxinxina, dunuɲa muxune mi yi i kolon, koni n tan i kolon, e fan bata a kolon a i tan nan n xɛxi. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>N bata a liga, e yi i kolon. N na ligama nɛn, alogo i n xanuxi xanuntenyaan naxan na, na xa lu e tan fan yi, n tan fan yi lu e yi.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu suxu fena</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.47-56, Maraka 14.43-50, Luka 22.47-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Yesu yelin Ala maxandɛ waxatin naxan yi, e nun a xarandiine yi siga, e sa dangu Kedirɔn lanbanna fɔxɔ kedenni, oliwi wudi bili nakɔɔn yireni, e nun a xarandiine sa so dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Yudasi naxan Yesu yanfa, a a so yiini, na yi mɛnna kolon amasɔtɔ Yesu nun a xarandiine yi darixi e malanɲɛ mɛnna nin. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Yudasi yi fa nakɔni, e nun Romi sofa ganla nun Yahudiyane kantan muxune, saraxarali kuntigine nun Farisi muxune naxanye xɛxi. Xaye dɛgɛne nun lɛnpune nun yɛngɛ so seene yi e yii.<verse eid="JHN 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Feen naxanye fama ligadeni Yesu ra, a yi ne birin kolon. Yesu yi fa e fɛma, a yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ nde fenma?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nxu Yesu Nasarɛti kaan nan fenma.” Yesu naxa, “N tan ni i ra.” Yudasi naxan a yanfama, a a so yiini, na fan yi tixi e tagi. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Yesu to a fala, a naxa, “N tan ni i ra,” e xɛtɛ e xanbi ra, e bira.<verse eid="JHN 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Yesu mɔn yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ nde fenma?” E yi a fala, e naxa, “Yesu Nasarɛti kaana.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Yesu yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata yi a fala ɛ xa, a n tan ni i ra. Xa ɛ n tan nan fenma, ɛ bonni itoe yiiba, e xa siga.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>A na liga nɛn alogo a fala tixin xa kamali, a naxa, “N Fafe Ala naxan birin fixi n ma hali na keden mi lɔxi ayi.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Silanfanna yi Simɔn Piyɛri yii.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">18.10</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> Piyɛri yi a botinɲɛ ayi, a Saraxarali Kuntigi Singena konyin yiifari ma tunla sɛgɛ a ma. Na konyin yi xili nɛn “Malikusi.” <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Yesu yi a fala Piyɛri xa, a naxa, “I ya silanfanna sɔti a tɛɛni! N Fafe tɔrɔ igelengenna naxan nagidixi n ma, n mi n minɲɛ na ra ba?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">E siga Yesu ra Anasa konni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Sofa ganla nun e mangan nun Yahudiyane kantan muxune yi Yesu suxu, e yi a xidi. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>E siga Yesu ra Anasa singe fɛma amasɔtɔ Kayafa bitan xɛmɛmaan nan yi na ra. Kayafa nan yi Saraxarali Kuntigi Singen na na ɲɛɛn na. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Kayafa nan bata yi Yahudiyane rakolon nun, a naxa, a fisa muxu kedenna xa faxa yamaan xa.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri a mɛ fena Yesu ra</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.69-70, Maraka 14.66-68, Luka 22.55-57</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simɔn Piyɛri nun xarandiina nde yi biraxi Yesu fɔxɔ ra. Saraxarali Kuntigi Singen yi xarandiin bonna kolon ki faɲi. Nanara, a so Yesu fɔxɔ ra Saraxarali Kuntigi Singena tanden ma kiti sadeni. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Koni Piyɛri yi tixi sansanna so dɛɛn dɛxɔn. Xarandiin bonna, Saraxarali Kuntigi Singen yi naxan kolon, na yi mini, a falan ti walikɛ ɲaxanla xa, naxan tixi dɛɛn na, na yi Piyɛri raso. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Walikɛ ɲaxanla naxan yi tixi dɛɛn na, na yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Xɛmɛni ito a xarandiina nde xa mi i fan na ba?” Piyɛri yi a yabi, a naxa, “N tan mi a ra.” <verse eid="JHN 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Xunbenla yi fama na waxatini. Nanara, walikɛne nun dɛ kantanne yi tɛɛn sa a ra, e yi tixi naxan xɔn e maxaradeni. Piyɛri fan yi tixi e yɛ a maxaradeni.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuntigin yi Yesu maxɔdin</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.59-66, Maraka 14.55-64, Luka 22.66-71</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Saraxarali Kuntigi Singen yi Yesu maxɔdin a xarandiine nun a xaranna fe ma. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “N bata falan ti yamaan birin xa kɛnɛnni, n yi darixi xaranna tiyɛ salide banxine nin hanma Ala Batu Banxini, Yahudiyane birin e malanma dɛnaxan yi. N mi sese falaxi wundoni. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>I n maxɔdinma na ma nanfera? Muxun naxanye n xuiin mɛxi, ne maxɔdin. E n ma fala tixine kolon ki faɲi!” <verse eid="JHN 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Yesu ito fala waxatin naxan yi, dɛ kantanna naxanye yi na yi, na nde yi a dɛɛn garin, a naxa, “I Saraxarali Kuntigi Singen yabima na kii nin?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “Xa n fala ɲaxin tixi, na sereyaan ba. Koni xa n ɲɔndin nan falaxi, nanfera i n garinxi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Nayi, Anasa yi a xidixin nasiga Kayafa ma, Saraxarali Kuntigi Singena.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri mɔn yi a mɛ Yesu a xarandiyaan na</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.59-66, Maraka 14.69-72, Luka 22.58-62</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Simɔn Piyɛri yi lu tixi na yi a maxaradeni. E yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “A xarandiina nde xa mi i fan na ba?” Koni Piyɛri yi a tandi, a naxa, “N tan mi a ra.” <verse eid="JHN 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Piyɛri Saraxarali Kuntigi Singena konyin naxan tuli sɛgɛ a ma, na kon kaana nde yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “N mi i tan xa to a fɛma oliwi bili nakɔni?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Piyɛri mɔn yi a tandi. Dontonna yi wuga keden na!<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">E siga Yesu ra Pilati konni</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 27.1-2, 11-14, Maraka 15.1-5, Luka 23.1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>E yi Yesu tongo Kayafa konni siga yamana kanna banxini. Xɔtɔn xɔtɔnna nan yi a ra nun. Yahudiyane yɛtɛɛn mi so yamana kanna banxini alogo Romi kaane nama e sariɲanna kala, bayo e yi sigama Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">18.28</char> <char style="fk">Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla:</char> Musaa waxatini, Ala fitina feen nafa nɛn Firawona yamaan ma, malekan yi fa e dii singene birin faxa kɔɛ kedenna ra. Koni, Isirayila kaane yi saraxa wunla xuya e banxine dɛ wudine ma, saya malekan yi dangu e xun ma. Na feen sanla ni ito ra. A mato Xɔrɔyaan 12.1-13 kui.</note> donse donden nin. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Pilati yi mini tandeni e fɛma, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ xɛmɛni ito kansunma feen mundun ma?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Xa xɛmɛni ito mi fe ɲaxi rabaxi, nxu mi yi fama a ra i fɛma nun.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilati yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ a tongo, ɛ yɛtɛɛn xa a makiti ɛ sariyan na.” Yahudiyane yi a yabi, e naxa, “Koni ɛ sariyan mi a ra, nxu xa muxun faxa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Ito ligaxi nɛn alogo Yesu naxan fala lan a faxa kiin ma, na xa kamali.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Pilati yi xɛtɛ yamana kanna banxini, a sa Yesu xili, a yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Yahudiyane Mangan nan i tan na ba?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “I yɛtɛna maxɔdinna ni ito ra ba hanma muxune nan a falaxi i xa?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilati yi a yabi, a naxa, “I mirixi a ma fa fala Yahudiyan nan n tan na ba? I kon kaane nun i ya saraxarali kuntigine nan i soxi n yii. I nanfe ligaxi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Dunuɲani ito gbee mi n ma mangayaan na. Xa dunuɲana ito gbeen nan yi n ma mangayaan na nun, n ma walikɛne yi yɛngɛn soma n xa nɛn nun alogo Yahudiyane nama n suxu. Koni iki, n ma mangayaan mi be xan yi.” <verse eid="JHN 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Nanara, Pilati yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Mangana nde nan i tan na nayi ba?” Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “I tan nan a falaxi fa fala a mangan nan n tan na. N barixi dunuɲa yi na nan ma, a n xa ɲɔndin seren ba. Naxan yo ɲɔndin xa, ne e tuli matima n xuiin na nɛn.” <verse eid="JHN 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilati yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Nanse ɲɔndin na?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">E Yesu faxa feen nata</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">Matiyu 27.15-31, Maraka 15.6-20, Luka 23.13-25</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">A to na fala, Pilati yi mini banxini, a mɔn yi siga Yahudiyane fɛma, a sa a fala e xa, a naxa, “N mi a yalagi xun toxi hali ndedi! <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Koni ɛ namunna nan a ra, n muxu keden yiiba ɛ xa Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla waxatini. Ɛ waxi a xɔn ma, n xa Yahudiyane mangan yiiba ɛ xa ba?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>E sɔnxɔ sɔnxɔ, e yi a yabi, e naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn, a tan mi a ra. Nxu waxi Baraba nan xɔn!” Anu, mafu tiin nan yi Baraba ra.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Nayi, Pilati yi Yesu tongo, e yi a bulan. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Sofane yi kɔmɔtin ɲali kanna rafala mangaya taxamasenna ra, e yi a so a xunna, e yi doma mamiloxin nagodo a ma. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>E yi lu fɛ a fɛma, e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Yahudiyane Mangana, i kɛnɛ.” E yi a garin.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilati mɔn yi mini, a yi a fala Yahudiya yamaan xa, a naxa, “Ɛ a mato, n xa a ramini ɛ ma tandeni, alogo ɛ xa a kolon a n mi a yalagi xun toxi mumɛ!” <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Nayi, Yesu yi mini tandeni, mangaya kɔmɔti ɲali kanna soxi a xun na, doma mamiloxin fan yi ragodoxi a ma. Pilati yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “A tan xɛmɛn ni i ra!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Saraxarali kuntigine nun dɛ kantanne to a to, e sɔnxɔ sɔnxɔ, e lu a falɛ, e naxa, “A xa gbangban, a xa gbangban!” Pilati yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ tan xa a tongo, ɛ sa a gbangban. N tan mi a yalagi xun toxi mumɛ!” <verse eid="JHN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Yahudiyane yi a yabi, e naxa, “Sariyana nxu yii, fata na sariyan na a daxa a xa faxa amasɔtɔ a bata a yɛtɛ findi Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn na.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Pilati to na mɛ, a yi gaxu kati! <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>A mɔn yi xɛtɛ yamana kanna banxini, a yi a fala Yesu xa, a naxa, “I tan kelixi minɛn yi?” Koni Yesu mi a yabi. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Pilati yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I mi n yabima? I mi a kolon fa fala sɛnbɛna n yii, n ni i beɲin hanma n ni i gbangban?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “Nɔ yo mi i yii n tan fari fɔ Ala naxan soxi i yii. Nanara, xɛmɛn naxan n soxi i yii na bata findi yulubi tongon na dangu i tan na.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Pilati na mɛ waxatin naxan yi, a beɲin xɔnla yi a suxu kati! Koni Yahudiyane yi lu sɔnxɔ sɔnxɔɛ, e naxa, “Xa i xɛmɛni ito beɲin, Romi Manga Gbeen Sesare xɔyi mi i tan na. Naxan yo a yɛtɛ findi mangan na, na bata keli Romi Manga Gbeen xili ma.” <verse eid="JHN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Pilati to falani ito mɛ, a Yesu ramini, a dɔxɔ a kiti sa gbɛdɛni, dɛnaxan xili “Gɛmɛ Kirana” dɛnaxan xili Heburu xuini, “Gabata.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla nan yi na xɔtɔn bode. Pilati yi a fala Yahudiyane xa, a naxa, “Ɛ mangan ni i ra, ɛ hɔn!” <verse eid="JHN 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>E lu sɔnxɔɛ, e naxa, “A xa faxa! A xa faxa! A xa gbangban!” Pilati yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ waxi a xɔn ma, n xa ɛ mangan gbangban wudin ma ba?” Saraxarali kuntigine yi a yabi, e naxa, “Manga yo mi nxu tan yii, ba Romi Manga Sesare ra.” <verse eid="JHN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Na xanbi ra, Pilati yi Yesu so e yii, a e xa a gbangban wudin ma.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu yi gbangban wudin ma</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">Matiyu 27.32-44, Maraka 15.21-32, Luka 23.26-43</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Nayi, sofane yi siga Yesu ra. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>A yɛtɛɛn yi a faxa wudin tongo, e siga yirena nde yi dɛnaxan xili “Xun Xɔri Yirena” dɛnaxan xili Heburu xuini, “Gologota.” <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>E yi sa a gbangban wudin ma mɛnni. E yi muxu firin fan gbangban wudin ma a fɛma, bonna a fɔxɔ kedenni, bonna fan a fɔxɔ kedenni. Yesu yi lu e tagi.<verse eid="JHN 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilati yi yamarin fi, e sɛbɛnla ti, e sa a singan a faxa wudin na, a naxa, “Yesu Nasarɛti kaana, Yahudiyane Mangana.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Yahudiya wuyaxi yi na xaran amasɔtɔ Yesu yi gbangbanxi wudin ma dɛnaxan yi, mɛn yi taan dɛxɔn ma nɛn, na yi sɛbɛxi Heburu xuiin nun Latin xuiin nun Girɛki xuiin nin. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Yahudiyane saraxarali kuntigine yi a fala Pilati xa, e naxa, “I nama a sɛbɛ fa fala ‘Yahudiyane Mangana,’ koni fa fala xɛmɛni ito naxa, a Yahudiyane Mangan nan a tan na.” <verse eid="JHN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilati yi e yabi, a naxa, “N naxan sɛbɛxi, n mi fa na kalama sɔnɔn.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Sofane to yelin Yesu gbangbanɲɛ wudin ma, e yi a dugine tongo, e yi a yitaxun dɔxɔde naanin sofa keden dɔxɔde keden. A doma bun biran naxan mi yi dɛgɛxi bayo dugi kedenna nan yi a ra, na yi lu. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Sofane yi a fala e bode xa, e naxa, “En nama a yibɔ, en masɛnsɛnna ti, a na naxan suxu, na yi a sɔtɔ.” Ito ligaxi nɛn alogo Kitabuna falan xa kamali, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“E bata masɛnsɛnna ti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">n ma dugine fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">e xa e yitaxun e bode tagi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">19.24</char> Yaburin 22.19</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Nayi, sofane yi na liga.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Yesu nga yi tixi a faxa wudin fɛma nun, e nun a ngaxakeden ɲaxalanmana, Mariyama, Kilofasi a ɲaxanla, e nun Mariyama Magadala kaana. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Yesu yi a nga tixin to na yi e nun a xarandiina, a yi naxan maxanuxi han! A yi a fala a nga xa, a naxa, “Nga, i ya dii xɛmɛn nan ito ra.” <verse eid="JHN 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>A yi a fala na xarandiin xa, a naxa, “I nga ni ito ra.” Na waxatin yɛtɛni, na xarandiin yi a nga tongo, a siga a ra a konni.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu faxa fena</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 27.45-56, Maraka 15.33-41, Luka 23.44-49</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Yesu yi a kolon fa fala feen birin bata yelin ligɛ, a naxa, “N kɔɛ yinla bata raxara.” A na fala nɛn alogo naxan sɛbɛxi Kitabuni na xa kamali.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">19.28</char> A mato Yaburin 22.16 nun 69.22 kui.</note> <verse eid="JHN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Ige sasena nde yi dɔxi na, na yi rafexi manpa muluxunxin na. E dugi dungina nde ragodo manpa muluxunxini, e yi a filin wudin ma naxan xili hisopi wudina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">19.29</char> <char style="fk">Hisopi</char> yi findixi sansi bili xurudina nde nan na e yulubi xafari wunla xuyama naxan na saraxabadeni. Na feen sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 12.22 kui.</note> E yi a lan Yesu dɛɛn ma a gbangban wudin kɔɛ ra. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Yesu to manpa muluxunna min, a yi a fala, a naxa, “A birin bata kamali.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Na danguxina, a yi a xun sin, a niin yi ba.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sofane yi Yesu ɲɛnsɛnna sɔxɔn tanban na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Yuman nan yi a ra, na xɔtɔn bode yi findima lɔxɔ binyen nan na Matabu Lɔxɔne yɛ. Yahudiyane kuntigine mi yi waxi e xa faxa muxune lu wudin kɔɛ ra Matabu Lɔxɔni. E yi a fala Pilati xa a e xa e sanne yigira alogo e xa e ragodo sinma. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Nanara, sofane yi siga, e yi xɛmɛn bonna sanne yigira naxan yi gbangbanxi Yesu dɛxɔn e nun bonna. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Koni e Yesu li waxatin naxan yi, e yi a to, a bata faxa. Nanara, e mi a sanne yigira. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Koni sofana nde yi Yesu sɔxɔn a ɲɛnsɛnni tanban na. Wunla nun igen yi mini a ma mafurɛn. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Naxan na toxi, na bata a seren ba. Ɲɔndin nan a sereyaan na. A tan yatigi a kolon a ɲɔndin nan falaxi. Nayi, ɛ fan xa dɛnkɛlɛya. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Na ligaxi nɛn alogo Kitabun sɛbɛnla xa kamali, a naxa, “Hali a xɔri kedenna mi yigirɛ.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">19.36</char> A mato Xɔrɔyaan 12.46 nun Yatɛne 9.12 nun Yaburin 34.21 kui.</note><verse eid="JHN 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>A sɛbɛxi yire gbɛtɛ yi Kitabun kui, a naxa, “E muxun naxan yisɔxɔnxi, e e yɛɛn tima nɛn na ra.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">19.37</char> A mato Sakari 12.10 kui.</note><verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Maluxun fena</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 27.57-61, Maraka 15.42-47, Luka 23.50-56</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Na xanbi ra, Yusufu Arimate kaan yi Pilati mafan, a xa Yesu binbin tongo. Nba, Yesu a xarandiina nde nan yi Yusufu ra, koni wundoni, amasɔtɔ a yi gaxuxi Yahudiyane yɛɛ ra. Pilati yi tin. Nanara, a yi fa Yesu binbin tongodeni. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Nikodɛmi naxan siga Yesu fɛma kɔɛɛn na a fɔlɔni, na fan yi bira Yusufu fɔxɔ ra. Ture xiri ɲaxumɛn kilo tonge saxan, mirihi latikɔnɔnna nun latikɔnɔn gbɛtɛ basanxin nan yi a yii. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>E yi Yesu binbin kasangen dugi fixɛn nun ture xiri ɲaxumɛn na amasɔtɔ Yahudiyane namunna nan yi na ra. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Yesu gbangban wudin ma dɛnaxan yi, nakɔ yiren nan yi na dɛxɔn. Bilinganna nde yi na nun, muxe munma yi maluxun dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Na xɔtɔn bode Yahudiyane Matabu Lɔxɔn nan yi a ra, gaburun faranna to mi yi makuya, e sa Yesu maluxun mɛnni.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu keli feen gaburun kui</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 28.1-8, Maraka 16.1-8, Luka 24.1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Xatin subaxani benun kuye xa yiba, Mariyama Magadala kaan yi siga gaburu dɛɛn na, a yi a li, gɛmɛn bata ba gaburun dɛ ra. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>A gimatɔɔn yi siga Simɔn Piyɛri nun a xarandiin boden fɛma, Yesu yi naxan maxanuxi han, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “E bata Marigin ba gaburun kui, e a saxi dɛdɛ, nxu mi na kolon!”<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Piyɛri nun xarandiin bonna yi mini, siga gaburu dɛɛn na. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>E firinna birin yi siga e giyɛ koni xarandiin bonna yi dangu Piyɛri ra, a singe yi sa gaburu dɛɛn li. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>A yi a felen, a yi a yɛɛ masa, a yi kasangenna to gaburun faranna kui koni a mi so na. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Na xanbi ra, Simɔn Piyɛri yi fa, a yi so gaburu faranna ra kedenna, a fan yi kasangenna to saxi na yi. <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>Yesu xunna yi mafilinxi dugin naxan yi, na mafilinxin yi saxi a danna, a mi yi kasangenna dɛxɔn ma. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Nayi, xarandiin naxan singe sa gaburu dɛɛn li, na fan yi so a kui. A yi na yito, a yi dɛnkɛlɛya. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Amasɔtɔ e munma yi a famu naxan sɛbɛxi Kitabuni, naxan yi a falaxi a Yesu kelima nɛn sayani. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Na xanbi ra, xarandiine yi xɛtɛ e konni.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi mini kɛnɛnni Mariyama Magadala kaan xa</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 28.9-10, Maraka 16.9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Mariyama tan tixin yi lu wugɛ gaburu dɛɛn na. A wugama, a yi a felen a yɛɛ masadeni gaburun kui. <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>Yesu binbin yi saxi dɛnaxan yi nun, a yi maleka dugi fixɛ kan firin to dɔxi mɛnni. Kedenna dɔxi a xun saden binna ra. Bonna dɔxi a san saden binna ra. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>E yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “I wugan nanfera, nga ɲaxanla?” A yi e yabi, a naxa, “E bata n Marigin ba be yi, n mi a kolon e a saxi dɛdɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>A ito fala waxatin naxan yi, a yi a firifiri, a Yesu to tixi na yi. Koni a mi yi a kolon, xa Yesu nan yi a ra. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yesu yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “I wugan nanfera, nga ɲaxanla? I nde fenma?” Ɲaxanla yengi yi a ma, a nakɔ kantanna nan yi a ra. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N fafe, xa i tan nan a baxi be, i sigaxi a ra dɛnaxan yi, na fala n xa, n xa sa a tongo na.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Mariyama.” A yi a firifiri, a falan ti Yesu xa Heburu xuini, a naxa, “Raboni.” Na bunna nɛɛn, “Karamɔxɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I nama kankan n ma, amasɔtɔ n munma siga n Fafe Ala fɛma singen. Koni siga, i sa a fala ngaxakedenne xa, i naxa, a n tema n Fafe nun ɛ Fafe fɛma, n ma Ala nun ɛ Ala.” <verse eid="JHN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Nayi, Mariyama Magadala kaan yi siga a faladeni xarandiine xa fa fala a bata Marigin to, a bata falani itoe ti a xa.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi a xarandiine xɛ</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 28.16-20, Maraka 16.14-18, Luka 24.36-49</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Na xati kedenna ɲinbanna ra, xarandiine yi malanxi banxina nde kui, dɛɛn balanxi e ma amasɔtɔ e yi gaxuxi Yahudiyane yɛɛ ra. Yesu yi fa, a ti e tagi, a naxa, “Ɛ bɔɲɛn xa xunbeli.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>A yelinxini ito falɛ, a yi a yiine nun a ɲɛnsɛnna yita e ra. Xarandiine Marigin toxina, e sɛwa kati! <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yesu mɔn yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ bɔɲɛn xa xunbeli! N Fafe Ala n xɛxi kii naxan yi, n fan bata ɛ xɛ na kiini.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>A ito fala waxatin naxan yi, a yi a dɛ foyen fe e ma, a naxa, “Ɛ Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Ɛ na diɲa naxanye yulubiye ma, ne mafeluun sɔtɔma nɛn, ɛ na naxanye gbeeye ramara, ne gbeene ramarama nɛn.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nun Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Muxu keden yi a xarandii fu nun firinne yɛ, Tomasi, naxan mɔn yi xili “Gulunna,” na mi yi e fɛma Yesu fa waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Nanara, xarandiin bonne yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Nxu bata Marigin to!” Tomasi yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Xa n mi a gbangban funfun to a yiine kui, n yi n yii sonla raso a sɔxɔndene ra, n yi n yiin naso a ɲɛnsɛnna sɔxɔnden na, n mi lɛ a ra mumɛ!”<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Lɔxɔ xun keden danguxina, xarandiine mɔn yi e malan banxini, Tomasi yi e fɛma, dɛɛne yi balanxi. Koni Yesu yi fa, a ti e tagi, a naxa, “Ɛ bɔɲɛn xa xunbeli.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi a fala Tomasi xa, a naxa, “I yii sonla rafa, i yi n yiine mato. I yiini bandun, i yi a raso n ɲɛnsɛnni, alogo i nama dɛnkɛlɛyatareyaan liga, dɛnkɛlɛya.” <verse eid="JHN 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Tomasi yi a yabi, a naxa, “N Marigina, n ma Ala!” <verse eid="JHN 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Bayo i bata n to, i bata dɛnkɛlɛya ba? Muxun naxanye dɛnkɛlɛyaxi hali e munma n to, sɛwan ne xa!”<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛ xunna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yesu kabanako fe gbɛtɛ wuyaxi liga nɛn a xarandiine yɛɛ xɔri naxan mi sɛbɛxi Kitabuni ito kui. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Koni itoe sɛbɛxi nɛn alogo ɛ xa la a ra fa fala Alaa Muxu Sugandixin nan Yesu ra, Alaa Dii Xɛmɛna. Ɛ na dɛnkɛlɛya a ma, ɛ nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn a xinli.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi mini kɛnɛnni xarandii solofere tagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu mɔn yi a yɛtɛ makɛnɛn a xarandiine xa Tiberiyadi daraan dɛxɔn ma. A a yɛtɛ makɛnɛn kii naxan yi, na nan ito ra. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simɔn Piyɛri nun Tomasi naxan xili Gulunna, e nun Nataniyɛli naxan kelixi Kana taani Galile yamanani e nun Sebede a dii xɛmɛne nun xarandii firin gbɛtɛye, ne yi malanxi. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simɔn Piyɛri yi a fala bonne xa, a naxa, “N sigama yɛxɛ suxudeni.” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nxu fan sigama i fɔxɔ ra nɛn.” Nayi, e siga, e sa dɔxɔ kunkin kui. Koni e mi sese suxu na kɔɛɛn na.<verse eid="JHN 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Kuye yibaxina, Yesu yi fa ti daraan dɛ. Koni a xarandiine mi yi a kolon a Yesu nan yi a ra. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Banxulanne, ɛ bata yɛxɛna nde suxu ba?” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ yalaan nagodo kunkin yiifanna ma, ɛ nde suxuma nɛn na yi.” E to yalaan nagodo mɛnni, e mi nɔ a bandunɲɛ amasɔtɔ yɛxɛ wuyaxi bata yi e suxu yalaan na. <verse eid="JHN 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Yesu yi xarandiin naxan maxanuxi, na yi a fala Piyɛri xa, a naxa, “Marigin nan a ra!” Simɔn Piyɛri to na mɛ tun, fa fala Marigin nan a ra, a yi a domaan xidi a ra, amasɔtɔ a ragenla nan yi a ra. A tugan, a sin igeni. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Xarandiin bonne yi bira a fɔxɔ ra kunkin kui, e fa yalaan bandunɲɛ, a rafexi yɛxɛn na ken! Amasɔtɔ, e nun xaren mi yi tagi kuya, fɔ nɔngɔnna yɛ kɛmɛ firin ɲɔxɔn.<verse eid="JHN 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>E to xaren li, e yi tɛɛn to na, yɛxɛne yi ganma dɛnaxan yi e nun buruna. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ baxi yɛxɛn naxan suxude, ɛ fa na nde ra.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simɔn Piyɛri yi so kunkin kui, a yalaan bandun xareyaan na, a rafexi yɛxɛ xungbene ra. Kɛmɛ tonge suulun e nun saxan nan yi a birin na. Hali e to a wuyaxi suxu, koni yalaan mi yibɔ. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ fa ɛ dɛge.” Xarandiine sese mi susu a maxɔdinɲɛ fa fala, “Nde i tan na?” Amasɔtɔ e yi a kolon, a Marigin nan yi a ra. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Nanara, Yesu yi a maso, a burun tongo, a yi a so e yii. A yɛxɛn fan liga na kiini.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>A saxanden nan yi na ra Yesu xa a makɛnɛn a xarandiine xa, xabu a keli sayani.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nun Piyɛri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>E yelin xanbini e dɛge, Yesu yi a fala Simɔn Piyɛri xa, a naxa, “Simɔn, Yoni a dii xɛmɛna, i n xanuxi dangu itoe ra ba?” Piyɛri yi a yabi, a naxa, “Ɔn, n Marigina, i a kolon, i rafan n ma.” Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I yengi dɔxɔ n ma yɛxɛɛ diine xɔn.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Yesu mɔn yi a fala a xa a firindeni, a naxa, “Simɔn, Yoni a dii xɛmɛna, i n xanuxi ba?” Piyɛri yi a yabi, a naxa, “Ɔn, n Marigina, i a kolon, i rafan n ma.” Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I yengi lu n ma yɛxɛɛne xɔn.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Yesu mɔn yi a fala a xa a saxandeni, a naxa, “Simɔn, Yoni a dii xɛmɛna, n nafan i ma ba?” Piyɛri bɔɲɛn yi yifu amasɔtɔ Yesu bata a maxɔdin dɔxɔɲa ma saxan fa fala, “I n xanuxi ba?” Piyɛri yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N Marigina, i feen birin kolon, i a kolon, i rafan n ma.” Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I yengi dɔxɔ n ma yɛxɛɛne xɔn. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala i xa. I yi banxulanyani waxatin naxan yi, i yi darixi i yɛtɛ maxidɛ nɛn, i yi siga dɛnaxan na i kɛnɛn. Koni i na fori waxatin naxan yi, i yiine yibandunma nɛn muxu gbɛtɛ yi i maxidi, a siga i ra yire yi dɛnaxan mi rafan i ma.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Yesu yi na falama nɛn alogo a xa Piyɛri faxa kiin yita, a yi Ala binyama naxan xɔn. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Bira n fɔxɔ ra.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Piyɛri yi a firifiri, a yi xarandiin bonna to e fɔxɔ ra, Yesu yi naxan maxanuxi. A tan nan yi dɔxi Yesu fɛma e dɛgedeni, a Yesu maxɔdin waxatin naxan yi, a naxa, “Marigina, nde i yanfama, a i so yiini?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Awa, Piyɛri a toxina, a yi a fala Yesu xa, a naxa, “Marigina, nanfe ligama xɛmɛni ito ra?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “Xa n waxi a xɔn ma, a tan xa lu a nii ra han n fa, na nanfe ligama i tan na? I tan xa bira n fɔxɔ ra tun.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Nayi, falani ito yi xuya ayi Yesu a xarandiine tagi fa fala xarandiini ito mi faxama. Koni Yesu mi a falaxi fa fala a mi faxama, koni a a fala a xa nɛn, a naxa, “Xa n waxi a xɔn ma a tan xa lu a nii ra han n fa, na nanfe ligama i tan na?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Na xarandiin nan feni itoe seren bama. A tan nan mɔn itoe sɛbɛxi. En na a kolon fa fala ɲɔndin nan a sereyaan na.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fala dɔnxɛna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Yesu mɔn fe gbɛtɛ wuyaxi liga nɛn. Xa ne birin yi sɛbɛ nun, n ma miriyani, a kitabune mi yi xanɲɛ dunuɲani ito yi.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
